o":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100023.png","nombre":"Cecilia","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100023.png","nombre":"Cecilia","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104174.png","nombre":"Topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-alhaitham', 'genshin-impact', 'Alhacén (Alhaitham)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Alhatham.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'The current scribe of the Sumeru Akademiya, a man endowed with extraordinary intelligence and talent. He lives free — free from the searching eyes of ordinary people, anyway.

A capable person who keeps a low profile for too long is often perceived as someone with a mysterious identity and ulterior purposes. Alhaitham himself is a powerful rebuttal to all these cliché views: He is a brilliant man, but he is only an ordinary employee of the Akademiya, with a stable job and a cushy house in Sumeru, leading a carefree and comfortable life.

Sometimes, people find it next to impossible to catch the current scribe in his office. Little do they know about the scribe, other than his name, "Alhaitham," and that he is supposed to be present during work hours. The fact is, no one knows his whereabouts, and all they can do is leave documents and files on his desk.

Alhaitham couldn''t be more satisfied with how things are.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alhaitham%2FProfile', 'The current scribe of the Sumeru Akademiya, a man endowed with extraordinary intelligence and talent. He lives free — free from the searching eyes of ordinary people, anyway.

A capable person who keeps a low profile for too long is often perceived as someone with a mysterious identity and ulterior purposes. Alhaitham himself is a powerful rebuttal to all these cliché views: He is a brilliant man, but he is only an ordinary employee of the Akademiya, with a stable job and a cushy house in Sumeru, leading a carefree and comfortable life.

Sometimes, people find it next to impossible to catch the current scribe in his office. Little do they know about the scribe, other than his name, "Alhaitham," and that he is supposed to be present during work hours. The fact is, no one knows his whereabouts, and all they can do is leave documents and files on his desk.

Alhaitham couldn''t be more satisfied with how things are.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alhaitham%2FProfile', 'El actual escriba de la Academia de Sumeru, un hombre de gran inteligencia y talento. Vive su vida libremente y es prácticamente imposible de encontrar.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Alhac%C3%A9n%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112067.png","nombre":"Brocado rojo lujoso","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104134.png","nombre":"Esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112067.png","nombre":"Brocado rojo lujoso","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-aloy', 'genshin-impact', 'Aloy', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Aloy.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / DPS', null, null, false, 'Outcast, hunter of machines, Seeker, Anointed, Savior... Aloy had many identities in her original world, and she was destined on account of her genetics to be the heroine who would heal it.

Now, she has arrived in a new world, full of never-before-seen challenges, and once again, she throws herself gladly into the hunt.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Aloy%2FProfile', 'Outcast, hunter of machines, Seeker, Anointed, Savior... Aloy had many identities in her original world, and she was destined on account of her genetics to be the heroine who would heal it.

Now, she has arrived in a new world, full of never-before-seen challenges, and once again, she throws herself gladly into the hunt.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Aloy%2FProfile', 'Antes era una paria, pero hoy en día es una cazadora excepcionalmente ágil. Siempre esta preparada para hacer uso de su arco y sus flechas cuando es necesario.

Tratada como paria desde que nació, Aloy creció en las montañas salvajes cerca de donde habitaba la tribu que la repudió. Criada por un experto cazador, entrenó para cazar con el sigilo de un gato y eficacia mortal. Pero lo que más quería saber, no podría enseñárselo él. Por encima de todo, ella ardía en deseos de descubrir qué ocurrió cuando nació, quiénes eran sus padres y por qué fue marginada por la tribu.

La búsqueda de repuestas la llevó a un gran mundo mucho más peligroso de lo que ella nunca podría haber imaginado.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Aloy%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113020.png","nombre":"Flor cristalina","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113020.png","nombre":"Flor cristalina","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113020.png","nombre":"Flor cristalina","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112055.png","nombre":"Núcleo espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113020.png","nombre":"Flor cristalina","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104164.png","nombre":"Jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112055.png","nombre":"Núcleo espectral","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113020.png","nombre":"Flor cristalina","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-alyosha', 'genshin-impact', 'Alyosha', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Alyosha_Icon.png', '5', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / DPS', null, null, false, 'A "professional hunter" mastering the Snezhnayan snowfields. Beneath his calm demeanor, a fiercely distinct "ideal" seems to burn.

In Snezhnaya, the name "Alyosha" is exceptionally favored among the people.

This is not because some young hunter''s monumental deeds made it a household name, but because the name itself carries a beautiful promise that countless parents yearned for.

Fearless, innocent and kind-hearted...

They pray for their children to bear such virtues, wishing for them to escape the carving of fate just like the heroes in legendary tales.

Yet, they are oblivious to the harsh truth: the ice and snow of Snezhnaya never respond to prayers, and the bitter cold itself is a relentless rasp.

A mere name cannot breed true courage, and unarmed kindness cannot shield a child from the spear thrown by fate.

Only those who experience, fight, and live like heroes can break the curse of reality; only those who plunge their feet into the frozen wastes time and again stand a chanc', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alyosha%2FProfile', 'A "professional hunter" mastering the Snezhnayan snowfields. Beneath his calm demeanor, a fiercely distinct "ideal" seems to burn.

In Snezhnaya, the name "Alyosha" is exceptionally favored among the people.

This is not because some young hunter''s monumental deeds made it a household name, but because the name itself carries a beautiful promise that countless parents yearned for.

Fearless, innocent and kind-hearted...

They pray for their children to bear such virtues, wishing for them to escape the carving of fate just like the heroes in legendary tales.

Yet, they are oblivious to the harsh truth: the ice and snow of Snezhnaya never respond to prayers, and the bitter cold itself is a relentless rasp.

A mere name cannot breed true courage, and unarmed kindness cannot shield a child from the spear thrown by fate.

Only those who experience, fight, and live like heroes can break the curse of reality; only those who plunge their feet into the frozen wastes time and again stand a chanc', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Alyosha%2FProfile', 'Aliosha utiliza el modelo masculino mediano. Tiene la piel pálida, pecas, el pelo de un tono verde menta pastel y los ojos amarillos. Lleva una camisa negra, sobre la que se pone un abrigo azul y blanco, y encima una túnica roja y beige con cuello de piel blanco. Lleva un Electro Vision sujeto a una pequeña bolsa que lleva en la pierna derecha.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Aliosha%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101276.png","nombre":"Hierbalana","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112149.png","nombre":"Semilla quimérica","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101276.png","nombre":"Hierbalana","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112149.png","nombre":"Semilla quimérica","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113091.png","nombre":"Cola cercenada del surcacielos","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101276.png","nombre":"Hierbalana","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112150.png","nombre":"Célula quimérica simbiótica","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113