  ('gi-arataki-itto', 'genshin-impact', 'Arataki Itto', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Itto.png', '5', 'Geo', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'While walking through Hanamizaka, it is hard not to notice a young man of the oni race named Arataki Itto.

Never mind his horns or piercing voice sticking out like sore thumbs — the sight of him enthusiastically joining in to play childrens'' games is enough to set him apart from the crowd.

In any case, his obvious lack of things to do stands in stark contrast to Hanamizaka itself, where craftspeople gather in droves and busy themselves all day long.

Itto claims to be the "first and greatest head of the Arataki Gang," the responsibilities and duties of which he tried to explain to some Tenryou Commission officials when they came to him to investigate a rather harmless street brawl.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Arataki%20Itto%2FProfile', 'While walking through Hanamizaka, it is hard not to notice a young man of the oni race named Arataki Itto.

Never mind his horns or piercing voice sticking out like sore thumbs — the sight of him enthusiastically joining in to play childrens'' games is enough to set him apart from the crowd.

In any case, his obvious lack of things to do stands in stark contrast to Hanamizaka itself, where craftspeople gather in droves and busy themselves all day long.

Itto claims to be the "first and greatest head of the Arataki Gang," the responsibilities and duties of which he tried to explain to some Tenryou Commission officials when they came to him to investigate a rather harmless street brawl.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Arataki%20Itto%2FProfile', 'El primer gran líder de la Banda de Arataki, muy activo en la zona de Hanamizaka de la Ciudad de Inazuma. ¿Nunca habías oído hablar de la Banda de Arataki? ¿En serio?

Itto es probablemente un descendiente de Arataki, un famoso artista marcial en la historia de Inazuma. Basándose en los epítetos que él diseña por sí mismo, así como en las descripciones físicas que otros NPC le han dado, tiene sangre oni corriendo por sus venas.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Arataki%20Itto%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113030.png","nombre":"Cuerno del Rey Acechador","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113030.png","nombre":"Cuerno del Rey Acechador","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113030.png","nombre":"Cuerno del Rey Acechador","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113030.png","nombre":"Cuerno del Rey Acechador","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104174.png","nombre":"Topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113030.png","nombre":"Cuerno del Rey Acechador","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-arlecchino', 'genshin-impact', 'Arlecchino', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Arlecchino.png', '5', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, '"The Knave," Fourth of the Fatui Harbingers. Revered as "Father" by the children of the House of the Hearth.

The Hotel Bouffes d''ete, situated in the Vasari Passage, is a lovely building with clean walls and sparkling windows, and well-mannered, well-groomed children frequent it every day.

Unlike other mansions of comparable beauty in the Court of Fontaine, the registered owner of this property does not live on-site. Indeed, nearby residents have not even heard of her.

The signature on the relevant documentation is but a false identity — the real power lies with someone else.

If one could hear the children whisper at night behind the Hotel''s closed gates, one would hear this appellation: "Father."

When speaking of "Father," some faces turn worshipful, some hearts are seized with fear, and still others look inscrutable, torn — but their tone always becomes one of respect.

These children are part of the organization known as the House of the Hearth.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Arlecchino%2FProfile', '"The Knave," Fourth of the Fatui Harbingers. Revered as "Father" by the children of the House of the Hearth.

The Hotel Bouffes d''ete, situated in the Vasari Passage, is a lovely building with clean walls and sparkling windows, and well-mannered, well-groomed children frequent it every day.

Unlike other mansions of comparable beauty in the Court of Fontaine, the registered owner of this property does not live on-site. Indeed, nearby residents have not even heard of her.

The signature on the relevant documentation is but a false identity — the real power lies with someone else.

If one could hear the children whisper at night behind the Hotel''s closed gates, one would hear this appellation: "Father."

When speaking of "Father," some faces turn worshipful, some hearts are seized with fear, and still others look inscrutable, torn — but their tone always becomes one of respect.

These children are part of the organization known as the House of the Hearth.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Arlecchino%2FProfile', 'Rosalyne murió en una tierra extranjera. Pero ustedes, hombres de negocios y dignatarios desalmados siempre tienen una excusa conveniente para permanecer en la comodidad de su patria. Nunca lo entenderían. Así que, ¿por qué mejor no se callan? No queremos hacer llorar a los niños.
Hace varios años, cuando era una niña, Arlecchino se enfrentó a la anterior poseedora del título de La Sota y acabó sucediéndola. Reformó la Casa de la Hoguera; aunque estricta, insistía en que la Casa se mantuviera de forma colectiva, permitía a sus miembros completar las tareas a su manera y no los castigaba tan severamente como su predecesora.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Arlecchino%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104114.png","nombre":"Ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-baizhu', 'genshin-impact', 'Baizhu', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Baizhuer.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer) / Buffer', null, null, false, 'The owner of Bubu Pharmacy, the finest pharmacy in all of Liyue. He is rarely seen without a white snake named Changsheng coiled around his shoulders. His prescriptions are varied and diverse, and his medical prowess and compassion are known throughout Teyvat.

Baizhu, the owner of "Bubu Pharmacy," is a master of the medicinal arts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Baizhu%2FProfile', 'The owner of Bubu Pharmacy, the finest pharmacy in all of Liyue. He is rarely seen without a white snake named Changsheng coiled around his shoulders. His prescriptions are varied and diverse, and his medical prowess and compassion are known throughout Teyvat.

Baizhu, the owner of "Bubu Pharmacy," is a master of the medicinal arts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Baizhu%2FProfile', 'El dueño de la Farmacia Bubu, siempre con una serpiente blanca llamada Changsheng colgándole del cuello. Gran conocedor de la medicina, sus auténticas intenciones son un verdadero misterio.

Baizhu se presenta en la misión "Guizhong", después de que el Viajero y Zhongli regresan a Qiqi con las manos vacías después de que ella les pide que cacen a un "Adeptus legendario" llamado "Cococabra". Después de que se dieron cuenta de que Qiqi había estado buscando leche de coco todo el tiempo, Baizhu se muestra y se revela como el dueño de la Farmacia Bubu, algo que ni siquiera Zhongli sabía. Ofrece tres millones de moras a cambio de Incienso eterno, una suma considerable que obliga al grupo a pedirle a Nobile que pague por ellos. Después, Baizhu comenta sobre su "extraño" encuentro y Changsheng advierte al Viajero que probablemente intentará desplumarlos.

El Herborista Gui, otro empleado de la Farmacia Bubu, comenta que Baizhu sufre de una dolencia desconocida que lo debilita bastante.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Baizhu%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113045.png","nombre":"Aro sombrioeterno","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113045.png","nombre":"Aro sombrioeterno","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113045.png","nombre":"Aro sombrioeterno","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112061.png","nombre":"Polvo quistecristalino","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113045.png","nombre":"Aro sombrioeterno","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100034.png","nombre":"Campanita de cristal","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104134.png","nombre":"Esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112061.png","nombre":"Polvo quistecristalino","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113045.png","nombre":"Aro sombrioeterno","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-barbara', 'genshin-impact', 'Bárbara', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Barbara.png', '4', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'The Deaconess of the Favonius Church and a shining starlet adored by all. Although the concept of a starlet is rather novel in a city of bards, the people of Mondstadt love Barbara nonetheless. "I owe everything to the city''s spirit of freedom" — Barbara, regarding her popularity.

Barbara is the Deaconess of the Church of Favonius, as well as the shining idol of Mondstadt.

"The sight of Barbara makes all my problems disappear." This is quite a common saying among the citizens of Mondstadt.

In fact, Barbara can do much more than just put people in a better mood: Her healing powers extend to flesh wounds and other physical ailments.

Barbara is known to have access to miraculous healing powers through her Hydro Vision.

However, Barbara herself knows that hard work is the most miraculous magic of all.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Barbara%2FProfile', 'The Deaconess of the Favonius Church and a shining starlet adored by all. Although the concept of a starlet is rather novel in a city of bards, the people of Mondstadt love Barbara nonetheless. "I owe everything to the city''s spirit of freedom" — Barbara, regarding her popularity.

Barbara is the Deaconess of the Church of Favonius, as well as the shining idol of Mondstadt.

"The sight of Barbara makes all my problems disappear." This is quite a common saying among the citizens of Mondstadt.

In fact, Barbara can do much more than just put people in a better mood: Her healing powers extend to flesh wounds and other physical ailments.

Barbara is known to have access to miraculous healing powers through her Hydro Vision.

However, Barbara herself knows that hard work is the most miraculous magic of all.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Barbara%2FProfile', 'Todos los habitantes de Mondstadt adoran a Bárbara. Ella vio por primera vez la palabra “ídolo” en una revista.

La diaconisa de la iglesia Favonius y una estrella brillante adorada por todos. Aunque el concepto de una estrella joven es bastante novedoso en una ciudad de bardos, la gente de Mondstadt ama a Bárbara de todos modos.

Bárbara es la diaconisa de la iglesia Favonius, así como la ídolo brillante de Mondstadt.

"Ver a Bárbara hace que todos mis problemas desaparezcan". Este es un dicho bastante común entre los habitantes de Mondstadt.

De hecho, Bárbara puede hacer mucho más que poner a la gente de mejor humor: sus poderes curativos se extienden a las heridas de la carne y otras dolencias físicas. Se sabe que Bárbara tiene acceso a poderes curativos milagrosos a través de su Visión Hydro.

Sin embargo, la propia Bárbara sabe que la magia más milagrosa de todas es el trabajo duro.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/B%C3%A1rbara%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100025.png","nombre":"Seta filanemo","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104124.png","nombre":"Lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-beidou', 'genshin-impact', 'Beidou', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Beidou.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Tanque', null, null, false, 'Captain of the Crux, with quite the reputation in Liyue. There are those who say she can split mountains and part the sea. Others say she draws lightning through her sword. Some say that even the mightiest of sea beasts are no match for her. For those not from Liyue, it may sound like a hearty joke, but those that have sailed with her will say— "No matter what sea beasts there may be, Beidou will be sure to split them all in two."

Beidou is the leader of The Crux — an armed crew based in Liyue Harbor.

An armed crew means exactly what it sounds like: a crew of sailors armed to the teeth.

Without getting into too many details, everything The Crux does is approved by the Qixing... more or less.

Beidou is a trusted leader, so much so that her crew believes her capable of taming the storms and billows on the sea.

"It''s Beidou! Even the mightiest of storms must bow its head to her might!"', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Beidou%2FProfile', 'Captain of the Crux, with quite the reputation in Liyue. There are those who say she can split mountains and part the sea. Others say she draws lightning through her sword. Some say that even the mightiest of sea beasts are no match for her. For those not from Liyue, it may sound like a hearty joke, but those that have sailed with her will say— "No matter what sea beasts there may be, Beidou will be sure to split them all in two."

Beidou is the leader of The Crux — an armed crew based in Liyue Harbor.

An armed crew means exactly what it sounds like: a crew of sailors armed to the teeth.

Without getting into too many details, everything The Crux does is approved by the Qixing... more or less.

Beidou is a trusted leader, so much so that her crew believes her capable of taming the storms and billows on the sea.

"It''s Beidou! Even the mightiest of storms must bow its head to her might!"', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Beidou%2FProfile', 'Capitana de la Flota Crux Meridianam y su tripulación. Es una mujer bastante libre y franca.

Hay quienes dicen que puede dividir las montañas y separar el mar. Otros que dispara rayos con su espada. Algunos que incluso la más poderosa de las bestias marinas no es rival para ella.

Para los que no son de Liyue, creerán que están siendo exagerados, pero los que han navegado con ella dirán... "No importa qué bestias marinas se encuentre, Beidou se asegurará de dividirlas todas en dos".', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Beidou%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100028.png","nombre":"Jade noctilucoso","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100028.png","nombre":"Jade noctilucoso","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100028.png","nombre":"Jade noctilucoso","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112036.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo plateada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100028.png","nombre":"Jade noctilucoso","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"ht