  ('gi-bennett', 'genshin-impact', 'Bennett', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Bennett.png', '4', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'Buffer / Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'One of the few young adventurers of the Mondstadt Adventurers'' Guild, he is always plagued with inexplicable bad luck. He is the only active member of his own adventure group, known as "Benny''s Adventure Team," after all the other members decided to "take leave" following a series of unfortunate incidents. As a result, the team is currently on the verge of being dissolved.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Bennett%2FProfile', 'One of the few young adventurers of the Mondstadt Adventurers'' Guild, he is always plagued with inexplicable bad luck. He is the only active member of his own adventure group, known as "Benny''s Adventure Team," after all the other members decided to "take leave" following a series of unfortunate incidents. As a result, the team is currently on the verge of being dissolved.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Bennett%2FProfile', 'El chico aventurero de Mondstadt. Su naturaleza amable no va acorde con su mala suerte.

Los pocos jóvenes aventureros del Gremio de Aventureros de Mondstadt han sufrido desgracias insospechadas al salir de aventura con Bennett.

Él es el único miembro activo de su propio grupo de aventureros, conocido como la "Brigada de Benny", luego de que todos los demás miembros decidieron "ausentarse" después de una serie de calamidades. Como resultado, el equipo está actualmente a punto de ser disuelto.

Katheryne del Gremio de Aventureros, quien no tiene el valor de romperle el corazón, ha decidido mantener la "Brigada de Benny" en los registros, mientras que a la vez oculta el hecho de que todos los demás miembros han dejado oficialmente el equipo desde hace mucho tiempo.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Bennett%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113011.png","nombre":"Semilla de fuego eterno","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112036.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo plateada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113011.png","nombre":"Semilla de fuego eterno","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112036.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo plateada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113011.png","nombre":"Semilla de fuego eterno","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112037.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo dorada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113011.png","nombre":"Semilla de fuego eterno","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104114.png","nombre":"Ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112037.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo dorada","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113011.png","nombre":"Semilla de fuego eterno","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-candace', 'genshin-impact', 'Candace', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Candace.png', '4', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Buffer / Tanque', null, null, false, 'The guardian of Aaru Village who is gentle and benevolent. She will not allow anyone to harm Aaru Village under her watch.

Candace, who has heterochromatic eyes, serves as the guardian of Aaru Village.

Candace always shows the greatest kindness to all travelers visiting the village, and she will not pursue an inadvertent faux pas so long as that person corrects themselves in time. In Candace''s view, the village rules are the most important thing. So long as these boundaries are respected, anyone can be allowed to rest in Aaru Village.

But woe betide those who regard this tolerance as weakness. Those who try to do anything illegal in Aaru Village will definitely pay the price.

By then, they will find that Candace''s lance and shield truly are the most frightening of weapons.

The scion of Al-Ahmar, a member of desert folk, the Guardian...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Candace%2FProfile', 'The guardian of Aaru Village who is gentle and benevolent. She will not allow anyone to harm Aaru Village under her watch.

Candace, who has heterochromatic eyes, serves as the guardian of Aaru Village.

Candace always shows the greatest kindness to all travelers visiting the village, and she will not pursue an inadvertent faux pas so long as that person corrects themselves in time. In Candace''s view, the village rules are the most important thing. So long as these boundaries are respected, anyone can be allowed to rest in Aaru Village.

But woe betide those who regard this tolerance as weakness. Those who try to do anything illegal in Aaru Village will definitely pay the price.

By then, they will find that Candace''s lance and shield truly are the most frightening of weapons.

The scion of Al-Ahmar, a member of desert folk, the Guardian...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Candace%2FProfile', '"Una vez le regalé unas cuantas alhajas a Candance y le dije que tenía que aprender a disfrutar de la vida y divertirse más a menudo. Pero ella me respondió que era feliz al contemplar la aldea en paz... *Suspira*, supongo que nuestra guardiana tiene su particular forma de disfrutar de la vida..."
"Esa tal Candace... es digna descendiente del Rey Deshret".

Este comentario lo hizo un avergonzado y tembloroso miembro de Los Eremitas en la taberna de la Ciudad de Sumeru.

Esta guardiana con heterocromía bendecida por los dioses es capaz de invocar tormentas de arena que engullen a los enemigos a su paso.

Un miembro de los Ladrones de Tesoros que acababa de anunciar que dejaba la organización añadió que Candace tiene control sobre cada grano de arena del desierto.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Candace%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bo