  ('gi-charlotte', 'genshin-impact', 'Charlotte', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Charlotte.png', '4', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'Indefatigable reporter of The Steambird, constantly on the hunt for the "truth."

In the Court of Fontaine, a new "story" is born every minute.

For example, Romaritime Harbor might suddenly swell with new ships, crewed by sailors of obviously non-Fontainian origin. Some fishmonger in Poisson might suddenly buy three months'' worth of fish in a single month, or countless flyers boasting of a certain place where especially delicious fish can be found might suddenly appear in the Court...

In the eyes of a mediocre reporter or ordinary city folk, these are "independent" tales, just like there will always be waves rippling across the sea''s surface — such ordinary events are barely worth paying attention to at all.

Clumsier journalists might even chase these waves, and dispiritedly end up merely following the wave''s patterns, constantly pumping out "surface-level stories" of little interest.

But in Charlotte''s eyes, these waves are but the superficial representation of other forces.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Charlotte%2FProfile', 'Indefatigable reporter of The Steambird, constantly on the hunt for the "truth."

In the Court of Fontaine, a new "story" is born every minute.

For example, Romaritime Harbor might suddenly swell with new ships, crewed by sailors of obviously non-Fontainian origin. Some fishmonger in Poisson might suddenly buy three months'' worth of fish in a single month, or countless flyers boasting of a certain place where especially delicious fish can be found might suddenly appear in the Court...

In the eyes of a mediocre reporter or ordinary city folk, these are "independent" tales, just like there will always be waves rippling across the sea''s surface — such ordinary events are barely worth paying attention to at all.

Clumsier journalists might even chase these waves, and dispiritedly end up merely following the wave''s patterns, constantly pumping out "surface-level stories" of little interest.

But in Charlotte''s eyes, these waves are but the superficial representation of other forces.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Charlotte%2FProfile', '"... Señorita Euphrasie, hace tres días, Charlotte, reportera de su periódico, siguió en secreto a unos criminales desde la Corte de Fontaine hasta el Puerto Rociomarino, arriesgándose a ser capturada y arrojada al mar por esta banda de maleantes... Lo siento, pero no nos importa eso de ''cuanto más cerca del suceso nos hallemos, más se acercará a la verdad el reportaje''.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Charlotte%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113052.png","nombre":"Dispositivo de Tubion","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113052.png","nombre":"Dispositivo de Tubion",