  ('gi-chasca', 'genshin-impact', 'Chasca', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Chasca.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'DPS / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'Whether mediating "disputes" stirred up by humans or by Saurians, or arbitrating with words or with bullets, all conflicts are resolved when the Peacemaker of the Tlalocan gets involved.

All humans hunger for power, and none can avoid conflict.

Some fight to protect their tribe and resist the Abyss, while others do so to prove themselves superior, greater, or more worthy of Mora, wine, power, and glory than their comrades.

But even those who love battle the most know to fear one name — Chasca.

So long as she is on the battlefield, even the fiercest fight will cease into silence in short order.

This is not entirely due to her eloquence or skill as a mediator, nor is it wholly a consequence of her ability to come up with satisfactory solutions based on her deep grasp of human nature. Instead, it''s more that...

This "Peacemaker" is just ludicrously strong, and she fights in a manner that makes a mockery of common sense.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chasca%2FProfile', 'Whether mediating "disputes" stirred up by humans or by Saurians, or arbitrating with words or with bullets, all conflicts are resolved when the Peacemaker of the Tlalocan gets involved.

All humans hunger for power, and none can avoid conflict.

Some fight to protect their tribe and resist the Abyss, while others do so to prove themselves superior, greater, or more worthy of Mora, wine, power, and glory than their comrades.

But even those who love battle the most know to fear one name — Chasca.

So long as she is on the battlefield, even the fiercest fight will cease into silence in short order.

This is not entirely due to her eloquence or skill as a mediator, nor is it wholly a consequence of her ability to come up with satisfactory solutions based on her deep grasp of human nature. Instead, it''s more that...

This "Peacemaker" is just ludicrously strong, and she fights in a manner that makes a mockery of common sense.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chasca%2FProfile', 'Comprendemos que últimamente nuestro comportamiento ha sido imprudente e impulsivo, por lo que acordamos dejar atrás este conflicto y continuar a partir de ahora mano a mano... Esta declaración es completamente voluntaria y sin objeciones. Además, nos gustaría darle las gracias a la mediadora por su excelente contribución en el proceso de reconciliación.
"... Esta niña no tiene salvación... ¡Por supuesto que yo tampoco puedo aceptarlo! Pero, por favor... desiste".

Tal fue el primer conflicto que oyó Chasca desde que llegó al mundo.

"¿Qué le pasa a esta niña? ¿Acaso la criaron los Qucusaurios? Con razón es tan salvaje...".

Así fueron los innumerables conflictos con los que se topó Chasca al regresar a la Tribu Plumaflora.

Aunque los recuerdos de su infancia se le antojen borrosos, Chasca se acuerda de las emociones que brotaban al escuchar palabras como aquellas: decepción, dolor, rencor y frustración...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Chasca%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113067.png","nombre":"Mirada abismática","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113067.png","nombre":"Mirada abismática","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png"