  ('gi-chevreuse', 'genshin-impact', 'Chevreuse', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Chevreuse.png', '4', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'Buffer / Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'The renowned Captain of the Special Security and Surveillance Patrol, always true to her own sense of "justice."

In the Court of Fontaine, where the corpus juris is exceedingly well-developed — some might even say convoluted — there are many odd ordinances that can confound and confuse foreign tourists.

For example, fruit tarts may not be placed directly on unheated platters, unfinished Fonta may not be intentionally placed in the middle of roads, and one must not forget to trim the claws of pet felines...

Violations are thus difficult to avoid. But Fontainians are quite familiar with such matters, quickly ascertaining the gravity of an offense and deciding on a course of action based on the identity of the one sent to deal with the matter.

If it is only a member of the establishment''s staff, then perhaps a simple debate will be sufficient to resolve the issue; who doesn''t enjoy a lively atmosphere?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chevreuse%2FProfile', 'The renowned Captain of the Special Security and Surveillance Patrol, always true to her own sense of "justice."

In the Court of Fontaine, where the corpus juris is exceedingly well-developed — some might even say convoluted — there are many odd ordinances that can confound and confuse foreign tourists.

For example, fruit tarts may not be placed directly on unheated platters, unfinished Fonta may not be intentionally placed in the middle of roads, and one must not forget to trim the claws of pet felines...

Violations are thus difficult to avoid. But Fontainians are quite familiar with such matters, quickly ascertaining the gravity of an offense and deciding on a course of action based on the identity of the one sent to deal with the matter.

If it is only a member of the establishment''s staff, then perhaps a simple debate will be sufficient to resolve the issue; who doesn''t enjoy a lively atmosphere?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chevreuse%2FProfile', 'La capitana de la Unidad Especial de Seguridad y Vigilancia. Su corazón siempre late por la justicia, y su mosquete solo apunta a los criminales.

Chevreuse creció en el Río Ceniciento. Ella es la actual Capitana de la Unidad Especial de Seguridad y Vigilancia y una cliente frecuente del Taller Beaumont, y a menudo compra materiales costosos para mantener su mosquete. Según Riqueti, Chevreuse ha comentado sobre el escaso uso de Mecagendarmes por parte de la Unidad mientras estaba bajo su mando, afirmando que "¡Los Mecagendarmes sólo bloquearán nuestras balas!"

En su tiempo libre, a Chevreuse le gusta leer, especialmente libros en los que la justicia prevalece sobre el mal. También tiene una obsesión enfermiza con la comida chatarra.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Chevreuse%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_Ite