  ('gi-chiori', 'genshin-impact', 'Chiori', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Chiori.png', '5', 'Geo', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'A frank and outspoken fashion designer whose unique sense of style always puts her at the forefront of Fontainian trends.

You push open the doors to the boutique. Situated on one of Fontaine''s busiest thoroughfares, it is named for its designer.

The crisp ringing of a bell chimes from above as if wishing luck to all customers who step through the door. If the rumors swirling about have even a grain of truth to them, then perhaps such blessings will come in handy.

"Welcome to the Chioriya Boutique, how may I help you?" The greeting that reaches your ears, while perhaps lacking somewhat in enthusiasm, is filled with assurance.

The owner of the voice shoots you a glance from behind the counter. A striking foreigner with captivating eyes — just like they said.

"A personalized, custom job? Or something off the shelf?" Her second question.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chiori%2FProfile', 'A frank and outspoken fashion designer whose unique sense of style always puts her at the forefront of Fontainian trends.

You push open the doors to the boutique. Situated on one of Fontaine''s busiest thoroughfares, it is named for its designer.

The crisp ringing of a bell chimes from above as if wishing luck to all customers who step through the door. If the rumors swirling about have even a grain of truth to them, then perhaps such blessings will come in handy.

"Welcome to the Chioriya Boutique, how may I help you?" The greeting that reaches your ears, while perhaps lacking somewhat in enthusiasm, is filled with assurance.

The owner of the voice shoots you a glance from behind the counter. A striking foreigner with captivating eyes — just like they said.

"A personalized, custom job? Or something off the shelf?" Her second question.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chiori%2FProfile', 'La dueña de la Sastrería Chiori y una famosa diseñadora de moda de Fontaine.

Tras un encuentro mientras le entregaba un paquete, Chiori confeccionó el atuendo actual de Kirara, Mezcolanza florífera, después de sentirse disgustada con su aspecto. Esto hizo que su tienda se hiciera más conocida a medida que la gente preguntaba por el traje. Ella también diseñó los atuendos usados por Lyney, Lynette y Navia, así como los accesorios para el Daguerrotipo de Charlotte, Monsieur Verite. Chiori es muy popular entre la gente de Fontaine, desde las clases altas hasta incluso hombres musculosos que la tratan con respeto y le hacen regalos; aquellos que la irrespetan son expulsados rápidamente de su tienda.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Chiori%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101204.png","nombre":"Dendrobio","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101204.png","nombre":"Dendrobio","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101204.png","nombre":"Dendrobio","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.