  ('gi-chongyun', 'genshin-impact', 'Chongyun', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Chongyun.png', '4', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Buffer', null, null, false, 'An exorcist who roams the land with Liyue as his base of operations, evil spirits fleeing wherever he goes. As the heir to a clan of exorcists, he has always possessed abilities superior to most. However, these abilities are not the result of training, but of an inborn trait — a pure yang spirit.

Throughout its long history, Liyue has never had a lack of rumors and myths regarding all manner of evil spirits and demons. And regardless of the truth of such rumors, someone has to do something about them.

Chongyun was born into a renowned family of exorcists, and has possessed a natural ability to drive away evil spirits from a young age due to his pure-yang spirit.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chongyun%2FProfile', 'An exorcist who roams the land with Liyue as his base of operations, evil spirits fleeing wherever he goes. As the heir to a clan of exorcists, he has always possessed abilities superior to most. However, these abilities are not the result of training, but of an inborn trait — a pure yang spirit.

Throughout its long history, Liyue has never had a lack of rumors and myths regarding all manner of evil spirits and demons. And regardless of the truth of such rumors, someone has to do something about them.

Chongyun was born into a renowned family of exorcists, and has possessed a natural ability to drive away evil spirits from a young age due to his pure-yang spirit.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Chongyun%2FProfile', 'Un joven exorcista procedente de una familia de exorcistas. Hace todo lo que puede para reprimir su propia “positividad congénita”.

Un exorcista que deambula por la tierra con Liyue como su base de operaciones. Los espíritus malignos huyen donde quiera que él va.

Como heredero de un clan de exorcistas, siempre ha poseído habilidades superiores a la mayoría.

Sin embargo, estas habilidades no son el resultado del entrenamiento, sino de un rasgo innato: la positividad congénita.

La positividad congénita es una fisiología extremadamente rara que hace que el cuerpo sea susceptible al calentamiento debido al exceso de energía positiva. Si no se controla, aquellos que poseen tal forma pueden tener rápidamente la sangre caliente. Chongyun es un caso particularmente grave, sus cambios de humor son explosivos y no recuerda nada de tales episodios.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Chongyun%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113010.png","nombre":"Núcleo de escarcha","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112006.png","nombre":"Máscara sucia","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113010.png","nombre":"Núcleo de escarcha","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemI