  ('gi-citlali', 'genshin-impact', 'Citlalí', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Citlali.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Tanque / Debuffer', null, null, false, 'A legendary shaman from the Masters of the Night-Wind, known throughout Natlan as the eminent "Granny Itztli." Not one to be messed with, but also the first person all turn to when trouble arises.

"Shamans" are practitioners of a mysterious craft who originate from the Masters of the Night-Wind. With many mystical abilities at their disposal, they are wise and powerful figures. In the eyes of the people of Natlan, whether one seeks medicine or wishes to decipher a cryptic prophecy, visiting a shaman is always the right choice. They can be both doctors and prophets, playing indispensable roles both in everyday life and in matters of far greater import. In short, theirs is a highly respected profession.

Yet above the many shamans, there are "great shamans" in a league of their own. They say it is a title that only those who reach the very pinnacle of their mystical arts may earn — and indeed, throughout the entire history of Natlan, they have been few and far between.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Citlali%2FProfile', 'A legendary shaman from the Masters of the Night-Wind, known throughout Natlan as the eminent "Granny Itztli." Not one to be messed with, but also the first person all turn to when trouble arises.

"Shamans" are practitioners of a mysterious craft who originate from the Masters of the Night-Wind. With many mystical abilities at their disposal, they are wise and powerful figures. In the eyes of the people of Natlan, whether one seeks medicine or wishes to decipher a cryptic prophecy, visiting a shaman is always the right choice. They can be both doctors and prophets, playing indispensable roles both in everyday life and in matters of far greater import. In short, theirs is a highly respected profession.

Yet above the many shamans, there are "great shamans" in a league of their own. They say it is a title that only those who reach the very pinnacle of their mystical arts may earn — and indeed, throughout the entire history of Natlan, they have been few and far between.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Citlali%2FProfile', '"Siempre he pensado que Citlalí tenía madera de líder y que, tarde o temprano, se convertiría en la jefa de los Augures Vientonocturno. Sin embargo, han pasado doscientos años y sigue sin mostrar interés alguno en salir de casa. Si alguien pudiera convencerla más que esas novelas ligeras, tal vez lograría que esta chamana tan talentosa prestara más atención al mundo real... pero, de nuevo, ¿quién podría hacer eso?".

Cada vez que un niño empieza a llorar desconsoladamente, los padres de los Augures Vientonocturno recurren al nombre de la abu Itztli para obtener resultados inmediatos.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Citlal%C3%AD%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101249.png","nombre":"Quenepa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101249.png","nombre":"Quenepa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101249.png","nombre":"Quenepa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101249.png","nombre":"Quenepa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":18}