  ('gi-clorinde', 'genshin-impact', 'Clorinde', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Clorinde.png', '5', 'Electro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'The mightiest Champion Duelist. Sword in hand, she defends justice in the Court of Fontaine.

Disputes are a Mora a dozen in Fontaine, day in and day out.

A confectioner might accuse another of stealing their recipe — and not only that, but replacing Bulle Fruit peel with Mint, thus bringing disgrace not only upon themselves, but upon the very dessert itself! Or a playwright might accuse a fanatical reader of imitating their style and taking up a pen name too close to their own, to the point that even the newspapers could not distinguish the genuine article.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Clorinde%2FProfile', 'The mightiest Champion Duelist. Sword in hand, she defends justice in the Court of Fontaine.

Disputes are a Mora a dozen in Fontaine, day in and day out.

A confectioner might accuse another of stealing their recipe — and not only that, but replacing Bulle Fruit peel with Mint, thus bringing disgrace not only upon themselves, but upon the very dessert itself! Or a playwright might accuse a fanatical reader of imitating their style and taking up a pen name too close to their own, to the point that even the newspapers could not distinguish the genuine article.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Clorinde%2FProfile', '... Te daré un consejo, amigo: las pruebas que hay en tu contra son irrebatibles. Si quieres defender tu honor, debes redimirte y llevar a cabo buenas acciones. No pienses en batirte en duelo para enmendar las cosas. ¡Tu oponente sería Clorinde! ''Esa'' Clorinde, ¿sabes? Por el amor de la Fontana Lucine... Si luchas contra ella, ¡ni siquiera tendrás opción de confesar!.
En la bulliciosa Corte de Fontaine, las disputas son el pan de cada día.

Un dramaturgo podría acusar a un lector ávido de imitar su estilo y adoptar un seudónimo demasiado parecido al suyo, hasta el punto de que ni siquiera los periódicos podrían distinguir quién es el autor original.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Clorinde%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112081.png","nombre":"Fragmento extramarino","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/as