  ('gi-cyno', 'genshin-impact', 'Cyno', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Cyno.png', '5', 'Electro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'The General Mahamatra of the Akademiya, leader of all the Matras. He has a unique sense of humor that never fails to leave a deep impression.

