  ('gi-dahlia', 'genshin-impact', 'Dahlia', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Dahlia.png', '4', 'Hydro', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Deacon of the Church of Favonius and Herald of the Anemo Archon, as well as the church choir cantor. If one should seek the guidance of Barbatos, there is none better to consult than Dahlia. Be sure to bring plenty of baggage, he likes hearing people talk about their troubles.

In this city blessed by freedom, people choose to follow many different paths — from those who seek peace and leisure, to those who yearn for the thrill of adventure. As for Dahlia, well, he''s the kind of person whose morning prayers are filled with entreaties for trouble to come his way.

Deacon of the Church of Favonius and leader of the church''s choir, he is a man blessed by the gods who is said to hear the will of the divine. When the people face hardships and seek guidance from on high, it is Dahlia who leads their morning prayers, beseeching Barbatos for answers on their behalf.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dahlia%2FProfile', 'Deacon of the Church of Favonius and Herald of the Anemo Archon, as well as the church choir cantor. If one should seek the guidance of Barbatos, there is none better to consult than Dahlia. Be sure to bring plenty of baggage, he likes hearing people talk about their troubles.

In this city blessed by freedom, people choose to follow many different paths — from those who seek peace and leisure, to those who yearn for the thrill of adventure. As for Dahlia, well, he''s the kind of person whose morning prayers are filled with entreaties for trouble to come his way.

Deacon of the Church of Favonius and leader of the church''s choir, he is a man blessed by the gods who is said to hear the will of the divine. When the people face hardships and seek guidance from on high, it is Dahlia who leads their morning prayers, beseeching Barbatos for answers on their behalf.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dahlia%2FProfile', '"Para resolver un conflicto entre dos ciudadanos, es necesario aplicar la ley y la justicia. En cambio, Dahlia... Lo que él hace es llevar a la taberna a dos personas enfrentadas, no hablar del tema y dedicarse a beber hasta que, de algún modo que no entiendo, esas dos personas se convierten en amigos de copas. Pero... ¿de verdad eso soluciona el conflicto?".
Mucha gente de Mondstadt cree que Dahlia es el favorito del Arconte Anemo. Cuando alguien necesita que dicho Arconte le guíe, Dahlia suele recibir respuestas al preguntar a la deidad.

Por esta razón, los devotos que buscan las bendiciones de Barbatos a menudo se reúnen frente a Dahlia para contarle sus problemas.

Sin embargo, esto nunca ha sido una molestia para él, sino que, es más, hasta se divierte con ello.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Dahlia%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112013.png","nombre":"Flecha veterana","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100056.png","nombre":"Lirio cala","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104124.png","nombre":"Lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112013.png","nombre":"Flecha veterana","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-dehya', 'genshin-impact', 'Dehya', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Dehya.png', '5', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'Tanque / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'A member of "The Eremites," a loosely-organized mercenary organization. She is brave, powerful, and enjoys an excellent reputation among mercenaries.

The term "Eremites" does not reference a specific group or organization, but all those who are born of the desert and ply a trade using their martial prowess, operating as mercenaries.

Frail is humanity in such a desolate profession. To survive, those who walk the path of a mercenary will naturally come together, forming loose bands of mercenaries.

Though the Eremites are many, few among them will be remembered as legends, with most bound to be as evanescent as sand in the wind. Yet there are exceptions who, like Dehya, may linger in the annals of history.

The "Flame-Mane" Dehya is fierce and brave, the lion her moniker invokes an analogy for her might. The nickname itself, meanwhile, denotes her passionate nature.

Should you be planning to hire a mercenary to serve as a bodyguard, Dehya stands as a prime choice.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dehya%2FProfile', 'A member of "The Eremites," a loosely-organized mercenary organization. She is brave, powerful, and enjoys an excellent reputation among mercenaries.

The term "Eremites" does not reference a specific group or organization, but all those who are born of the desert and ply a trade using their martial prowess, operating as mercenaries.

Frail is humanity in such a desolate profession. To survive, those who walk the path of a mercenary will naturally come together, forming loose bands of mercenaries.

Though the Eremites are many, few among them will be remembered as legends, with most bound to be as evanescent as sand in the wind. Yet there are exceptions who, like Dehya, may linger in the annals of history.

The "Flame-Mane" Dehya is fierce and brave, the lion her moniker invokes an analogy for her might. The nickname itself, meanwhile, denotes her passionate nature.

Should you be planning to hire a mercenary to serve as a bodyguard, Dehya stands as a prime choice.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dehya%2FProfile', 'Dehya, miembro de Los Eremitas, una organización de mercenarios del desierto de Sumeru. Es valiente, poderosa y goza de una gran reputación en dicha organización.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Dehya%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101222.png","nombre":"Crisálida arenosa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_