  ('gi-dori', 'genshin-impact', 'Dori', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Dori.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'Dori is a merchant in Sumeru who has a fondness for glittering Mora. With her persuasive eloquence, she is able to sell various strange and mysterious products for a very high price.

"Dori Sangemah Bay, owner of the Palace of Alcazarzaray, super-duper merchant who sells everything you need!"

When one holds Dori''s name card, this impressive title instantly comes into view.

Dori is, however, indeed the most special Sumeru merchant of all.

She already possesses vast wealth, but is still fervently passionate about earning Mora;

She already owns multiple well-renowned merchant caravans, yet she always travels across Sumeru to sell her marvelous items in person.

Speaking of which, her wares are just as curious as her style: special travel kit, outdoor dryer machines, automatic snowball launchers... You can probably buy anything you can think of from Dori. The only question is: Do you have enough Mora to do so?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dori%2FProfile', 'Dori is a merchant in Sumeru who has a fondness for glittering Mora. With her persuasive eloquence, she is able to sell various strange and mysterious products for a very high price.

"Dori Sangemah Bay, owner of the Palace of Alcazarzaray, super-duper merchant who sells everything you need!"

When one holds Dori''s name card, this impressive title instantly comes into view.

Dori is, however, indeed the most special Sumeru merchant of all.

She already possesses vast wealth, but is still fervently passionate about earning Mora;

She already owns multiple well-renowned merchant caravans, yet she always travels across Sumeru to sell her marvelous items in person.

Speaking of which, her wares are just as curious as her style: special travel kit, outdoor dryer machines, automatic snowball launchers... You can probably buy anything you can think of from Dori. The only question is: Do you have enough Mora to do so?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Dori%2FProfile', 'Una impredecible comerciante itinerante cuya mayor pasión es el Mora contante y sonante.

La impredecible Dori tiene mil y un tesoros.

Como la comerciante con mayor talento de Sumeru, Dori te conseguirá todo lo que necesitas, ya sean piedras preciosas, hierbas medicinales poco comunes o extraños artefactos de los que nadie ha oído hablar nunca.

Aunque, claro está, todo tiene un precio. Dori siempre tiene una sonrisa afable en el rostro, pero sus precios son terroríficos.

Algunos piensan que es como la lluvia después de una larga sequía. Otros opinan que es la mecha que prende el fuego.

Aunque ninguno de esos rumores llegará nunca a oídos de Dori. El único sonido que resuena en el Palacio Alcazarzaray es el tintineo de los Moras.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Dori%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113037.png","nombre":"Fruto atronador","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113037.png","nombre":"Fruto atronador","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.