  ('gi-emilie', 'genshin-impact', 'Emilie', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Emilie.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Support', null, null, false, 'A renowned perfumer from Fontaine. Elegant, charming, and a little mysterious... just like her work.

There is much that may be said when discussing a bottle of perfume.

We might speak of its fragrance: How it first bewitches with its top notes, before gradually melding with its wearer, and finally taking a subdued bow amidst the lingering aroma.

We could speak of the concept underlying its design: Is it meant to enliven the spirit, or to lend an aura of alluring mystique?

We might even debate the most appropriate occasion for its use: Would one be willing to attend a social ball clad in this aroma, or would it be better suited to suffusing the atmosphere of a private date?

Emilie finds these matters to be most worthy of discussion, as they are intimately related to how one selects a perfume.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Emilie%2FProfile', 'A renowned perfumer from Fontaine. Elegant, charming, and a little mysterious... just like her work.

There is much that may be said when discussing a bottle of perfume.

We might speak of its fragrance: How it first bewitches with its top notes, before gradually melding with its wearer, and finally taking a subdued bow amidst the lingering aroma.

We could speak of the concept underlying its design: Is it meant to enliven the spirit, or to lend an aura of alluring mystique?

We might even debate the most appropriate occasion for its use: Would one be willing to attend a social ball clad in this aroma, or would it be better suited to suffusing the atmosphere of a private date?

Emilie finds these matters to be most worthy of discussion, as they are intimately related to how one selects a perfume.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Emilie%2FProfile', 'Una perfumista de renombre de Fontaine. Elegante, encantadora y un poco misteriosa... igual que su trabajo.

Hay mucho que decir cuando se habla de un frasco de perfume.

Podríamos hablar de su fragancia: de cómo primero seduce con sus notas de salida, luego se funde poco a poco con quien lo lleva y por fin se despide con discreción entre un aroma que persiste.

Podríamos hablar del concepto que hay detrás de su diseño: ¿busca animar el espíritu o envolver a quien lo usa en un aura de misterio seductor?

Incluso podríamos discutir cuál es la ocasión más apropiada para llevarlo: ¿acudirías a un baile de sociedad con este aroma, o encaja mejor en la atmósfera de una cita privada?

A Emilie le parece que estas cuestiones merecen mucho la pena, porque tienen que ver directamente con cómo se elige un perfume.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Emilie%2FProfile', true, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101238.png","nombre":"Lirio lumilago","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101238.png","nombre":"Lirio lumilago","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101238.png","nombre":"Lirio lumilago","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113059.png","nombre":"Fragmento de melodía dorada","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101238.png","nombre":"Lirio lumilago","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":18},{"