  ('gi-escoffier', 'genshin-impact', 'Escoffier', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Escoffier.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'A renowned, exacting Fontainian chef. Diligently seeking the pinnacle of culinary excellence.

For many years, Fontainian cuisine — exemplified by a focus on elegant sophistication — has been a popular palate-pleaser throughout Teyvat. If you were to inquire among food critics as to what best embodies the principles of Fontainian food, few if any would omit the great "former head chef of the Hotel Debord," Escoffier, from the forefront of their name lists.

In the eyes of discerning diners, Escoffier is both the founder of "precision gastronomy" and a leading proponent of "the principles of innovative cuisine." She excels at taking flavorings measured with the precision of scientific rigor and crafting them into dazzling, dynamic taste experiences.

According to countless food critics, she is a "demon chef" who continues to breathe new life into the culinary world while sending shivers down the spines of dietary dinosaurs — those stubbornly unreceptive to change and fresh avenues in cu', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Escoffier%2FProfile', 'A renowned, exacting Fontainian chef. Diligently seeking the pinnacle of culinary excellence.

For many years, Fontainian cuisine — exemplified by a focus on elegant sophistication — has been a popular palate-pleaser throughout Teyvat. If you were to inquire among food critics as to what best embodies the principles of Fontainian food, few if any would omit the great "former head chef of the Hotel Debord," Escoffier, from the forefront of their name lists.

In the eyes of discerning diners, Escoffier is both the founder of "precision gastronomy" and a leading proponent of "the principles of innovative cuisine." She excels at taking flavorings measured with the precision of scientific rigor and crafting them into dazzling, dynamic taste experiences.

According to countless food critics, she is a "demon chef" who continues to breathe new life into the culinary world while sending shivers down the spines of dietary dinosaurs — those stubbornly unreceptive to change and fresh avenues in cu', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Escoffier%2FProfile', '"¿''El hada del dulce''?, ¿''la tirana de las papilas gustativas''? No es tan exagerado como lo pintan los periódicos. Escoffier no es más que una chica a la que le gusta cocinar... y que es un poco estricta. Quienes no se toman la cocina en serio no son dignos de su respeto. De todos modos, el ''sabor'' de ustedes dos seguro que combina la mar de bien, ¡no me cabe duda!".
Durante mucho tiempo, la columna gastronómica de «El Pájaro de Vapor» ha sido considerada por los gourmets como el lugar al que acudir en busca de nuevos sabores. Colaboradora habitual de esta sección, la antigua jefa de cocina del Bistró Debord, Escoffier, y su "cocina de precisión" gozan de gran reputación en toda Fontaine.

"Analizar", "extraer" y "mezclar". Lo que Escoffier desmenuza no son solo "extractos", sino también la percepción inherente de la gente de Fontaine acerca de lo "delicioso".', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Escoffier%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113076.png","nombre":"Acumulador de aire fuentenigma","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101232.png","nombre":"Caracola azurescente","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemI