  ('gi-faruzan', 'genshin-impact', 'Faruzán', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Faruzan.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Buffer / Debuffer', null, null, false, 'A distinguished Akademiya scholar from "a century ago" and one of the founders of Ancient Mechanics as a field of study. Although she hailed from Haravatat, she was renowned for her talents in machinery throughout Sumeru... Even though these honors have been forgotten in the river of time, much as she has.

If you were to open any Kshahrewar textbook, you will find Faruzan''s record penned proudly upon the author page.

"Faruzan, outstanding researcher of the Akademiya, winner of the Sumeru Puzzlers'' League Lifetime Achievement Award, one of the seminal scholars of Ancient Mechanics."

But if you were to talk to Haravatat students about their choices, they frown as they speak of Faruzan''s current state.

"Oh, you mean her... Well, her research is...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Faruzan%2FProfile', 'A distinguished Akademiya scholar from "a century ago" and one of the founders of Ancient Mechanics as a field of study. Although she hailed from Haravatat, she was renowned for her talents in machinery throughout Sumeru... Even though these honors have been forgotten in the river of time, much as she has.

If you were to open any Kshahrewar textbook, you will find Faruzan''s record penned proudly upon the author page.

"Faruzan, outstanding researcher of the Akademiya, winner of the Sumeru Puzzlers'' League Lifetime Achievement Award, one of the seminal scholars of Ancient Mechanics."

But if you were to talk to Haravatat students about their choices, they frown as they speak of Faruzan''s current state.

"Oh, you mean her... Well, her research is...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Faruzan%2FProfile', '"Gran parte del contenido de este libro procede de las investigaciones y manuscritos de doña Faruzán. Esperamos que las futuras generaciones de eruditos recuerden su nombre cuando vuelva a la Academia".

Entre los eruditos de la Facultad Kshahrewar circula una historia que dice así:

Si has suspendido los exámenes de mecánica y no te atreves a pedir clases de recuperación a tu tutor disgustado, puedes dirigirte a la Facultad Haravatat, que está al lado, y pedirle a doña Faruzán algunos consejos.

No es necesario preparar un regalo. Solo acuérdate de mostrar sinceridad y humildad y llamarla "doña Faruzán" respetuosamente. Eso será suficiente para ganarte a esta enciclopedia de mecánica andante.

Las explicaciones de doña Faruzán son sencillas pero perspicaces de entender, y sus profundos conocimientos hacen que la gente se pregunte si ha participado en la redacción del programa de estudios.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Faruz%C3%A1n%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113039.png","nombre":"Tetraedro guialuz","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101220.png","nombre":"Añoraescarlata","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_