  ('gi-fischl', 'genshin-impact', 'Fischl', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Fischl.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'A mysterious girl who calls herself "Prinzessin der Verurteilung" and travels with a night raven named Oz. Currently serves as an investigator in the Adventurers'' Guild. Through her unique abilities, eccentric character, and (while she would never admit it herself) hard work, Fischl has become a rising star among the Adventurers'' Guild''s investigators, earning the recognition of all.

Fischl is the Prinzessin der Verurteilung who arrived here after being exiled from the otherworld, "Immernachtreich."

She "observes and weaves the threads of fate" together with her talking night raven familiar, Oz.

Owing to reasons she cannot and Oz will not explain, Fischl now serves the Adventurers'' Guild as an investigator.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fischl%2FProfile', 'A mysterious girl who calls herself "Prinzessin der Verurteilung" and travels with a night raven named Oz. Currently serves as an investigator in the Adventurers'' Guild. Through her unique abilities, eccentric character, and (while she would never admit it herself) hard work, Fischl has become a rising star among the Adventurers'' Guild''s investigators, earning the recognition of all.

Fischl is the Prinzessin der Verurteilung who arrived here after being exiled from the otherworld, "Immernachtreich."

She "observes and weaves the threads of fate" together with her talking night raven familiar, Oz.

Owing to reasons she cannot and Oz will not explain, Fischl now serves the Adventurers'' Guild as an investigator.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fischl%2FProfile', 'Una chica misteriosa que se hace llamar “Princesa del Juicio”. Siempre camina junto con un cuervo oscuro llamado Oz.

Una chica misteriosa que se hace llamar "la princesa del juicio". Siempre camina junto con un cuervo oscuro, llamado Oz. Actualmente hace de investigadora en el Gremio de Aventureros. Con sus habilidades únicas, su carácter excéntrico y su duro trabajo (aunque ella misma nunca lo admitiría), Fischl se convirtió en una estrella en ascenso entre los investigadores del Gremio de Aventureros, ganándose el reconocimiento de todos.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Fischl%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112013.png","nombre":"Flecha veterana","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100055.png","nombre":"Lucetta","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104144.png","nombre":"Amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112013.png","nombre":"Flecha veterana","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-flins', 'genshin-impact', 'Flins', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Flins.png', '5', 'Electro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'Kyryll Chudomirovich Flins, a Ratnik of Nod-Krai — this is how he likes to introduce himself.

There is a small isle in the central-southern region of Nod-Krai that has earned the name "Final Night Cemetery" on account of its lonesome, dismal air. Few visit, and merchant caravans only sometimes loop far around it. Jutting above its soil is a lighthouse languishing in disuse, where only the spirits of the dead consent to dwell, it is said.

Amidst the deathly silence, only one living soul remains. This gentleman tends to introduce himself as such: Flins, a warrior of the Lightkeepers, the awardee of a civilian commendation medal in recognition of his squad''s efforts in repelling Abyssal creatures.

The incident he mentions happened a long time ago.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Flins%2FProfile', 'Kyryll Chudomirovich Flins, a Ratnik of Nod-Krai — this is how he likes to introduce himself.

There is a small isle in the central-southern region of Nod-Krai that has earned the name "Final Night Cemetery" on account of its lonesome, dismal air. Few visit, and merchant caravans only sometimes loop far around it. Jutting above its soil is a lighthouse languishing in disuse, where only the spirits of the dead consent to dwell, it is said.

Amidst the deathly silence, only one living soul remains. This gentleman tends to introduce himself as such: Flins, a warrior of the Lightkeepers, the awardee of a civilian commendation medal in recognition of his squad''s efforts in repelling Abyssal creatures.

The incident he mentions happened a long time ago.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Flins%2FProfile', '"El señor Flins vive en un faro muy lejano. Es muy proactivo y parece saber mucho sobre tácticas de combate... O al menos eso es lo que he oído. Lo siento, no tengo total certeza sobre ello. Me uní al equipo más tarde y nunca he trabajado con él, así que todo lo que he dicho se lo oí al starshiná. ¿Quieres saber qué pienso yo? Humm... Creo que tiene muchas historias que contar. Además, ¿no te parece sorprendente que, a pesar de ser un soldado, sea una persona de muy buenos modales y sepa usar su elocuencia para conseguir lo que quiere?".Cuando llega la temporada de cosecha, ningún visitante es un desconocido, por lo que cualquier persona puede aparecer durante las festividades.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Flins%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101261.png","nombre":"Flor velaescarcha","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101261.png","nombre":"Flor velaescarcha","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113077.png","nombre":"Troquel de “estam-pato” de kuuvahki preciso","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101261.png","nombre":"Flor velaescarcha","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.