  ('gi-gaming', 'genshin-impact', 'Gaming', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Gaming.png', '4', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'Gold-Standard Guard of the Sword and Strongbox Secure Transport Agency, and the head of the "Mighty Mythical Beasts" Wushou troupe. Talkative and full of zeal, he''s a classic people person.

