  ('gi-gorou', 'genshin-impact', 'Gorou', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Gorou.png', '4', 'Geo', 90, null, 'Buffer', null, null, false, 'Gorou is the great general of Watatsumi Island''s military, and he is deeply loved by his subordinates.

During the period of the Vision Hunt Decree, Gorou led the forces of Watatsumi against the Shogun''s Army, and successfully held the line against them.

The troops call him the "ever-victorious pointy-eared general," a nickname that has also seen broad use among Shogunate warriors.

In private, however, Gorou puts on no airs and is a straightforward person, which has led him to be regarded by all as the man with the plan.

But even such an exemplary general must have his fair share of troubles...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Gorou%2FProfile', 'Gorou is the great general of Watatsumi Island''s military, and he is deeply loved by his subordinates.

During the period of the Vision Hunt Decree, Gorou led the forces of Watatsumi against the Shogun''s Army, and successfully held the line against them.

The troops call him the "ever-victorious pointy-eared general," a nickname that has also seen broad use among Shogunate warriors.

In private, however, Gorou puts on no airs and is a straightforward person, which has led him to be regarded by all as the man with the plan.

But even such an exemplary general must have his fair share of troubles...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Gorou%2FProfile', '"La gentileza y la honestidad son la representación de la virtud. Sin duda, mi amigo Gorou es un general virtuoso".
Un general de Watatsumi destacado por su lealtad y coraje. Posee el instinto de combate innato de una bestia y encuentra la forma de hacerse con la victoria hasta en los momentos más críticos.

Lidera las tropas de Watatsumi, que disponen de muchos menos recursos militares en comparación con el shogunato. Gorou se esfuerza por garantizar que los habitantes de este lugar vivan seguros y en paz.

Tal vez los forasteros no puedan imaginar que Gorou, alguien que se enfrenta a miles de enemigos en el campo de batalla, en realidad es un muchacho de lo más amable que se lleva bien con todos sus subordinados.

Para Gorou, las personas que le rodean no solo son sus valientes soldados, también son sus queridos compañeros, son como un tesoro al que hay que cuidar y proteger. La tierra que nos sostiene, los compañeros que nos apoyan, la fe que nos anima a seguir adelante...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Gorou%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113023.png","nombre":"Corazón de la eternidad","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113023.png","nombre":"Corazón de la eternidad","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva