  ('gi-iansan', 'genshin-impact', 'Iansán', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Iansan.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'The head coach of the fitness club at the Collective of Plenty, a renowned Natlanese nutritionist, and the founder of the "Pilgrimage Victors Academy." Overwhelmed by the prospect of training? Unsure of how to improve your strength? In that case, she''s the first person you should talk to.

When the people of Natlan think about the Collective of Plenty, the first thing that springs to mind is the tribe''s culture of fitness — followed shortly by mental images of towering, muscular, chiseled physiques...

Many first-time visitors to the Collective of Plenty, therefore, are surprised to learn that the current leading light of the tribe''s fitness scene is about as far away from those mental images as it''s possible to be.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Iansan%2FProfile', 'The head coach of the fitness club at the Collective of Plenty, a renowned Natlanese nutritionist, and the founder of the "Pilgrimage Victors Academy." Overwhelmed by the prospect of training? Unsure of how to improve your strength? In that case, she''s the first person you should talk to.

When the people of Natlan think about the Collective of Plenty, the first thing that springs to mind is the tribe''s culture of fitness — followed shortly by mental images of towering, muscular, chiseled physiques...

Many first-time visitors to the Collective of Plenty, therefore, are surprised to learn that the current leading light of the tribe''s fitness scene is about as far away from those mental images as it''s possible to be.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Iansan%2FProfile', '"La entrenadora Iansán es la mejor instructora de ejercicio físico de toda Natlan, ¡y la persona a quien más respeto! Todo el mundo dice que tengo mucho talento, pero si no fuera por ella, probablemente habría desperdiciado mi talento comiendo. No te preocupes si no tienes el hábito de hacer ejercicio, ¡la entrenadora Iansán siempre se adapta a las circunstancias de sus alumnos! Ah, hablando de eso, ¿quiere echar un vistazo a este panfleto? ¡La entrenadora está reclutando nuevos estudiantes!".
"¿Quieres superarte a ti mismo? ¿Te gustaría ser más fuerte?".

"En ese caso, ¡ven a la Comunidad de la Feracidad y participa en el Curso de Formación para los Vencedores del Peregrinaje!', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Ians%C3%A1n%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101255.png","nombre":"Escamatita","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101255.png","nombre":"Escamatita","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113067.png","nombre":"Mirada abismática","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101255.png","nombre":"Escamatita","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112105.png","nombre":"Silbato de hierro del guerrero","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113067.png","nombre":"Mirada abismática","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101255.png","nombre":"Escamatita","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112105.png","nombre":"Silbato de hierro del guerrero","cant