  ('gi-ifa', 'genshin-impact', 'Ifa', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Ifa.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'A vet from the Flower-Feather Clan, beloved by humans and animals alike. The round creature by his side is his assistant.

In the eyes of the Natlanese, the Flower-Feather Clan lives in the sky. Although the Scions of the Canopy bound between their cliffs, and the Masters of the Night-Wind stargaze from their summits, only the Flower-Feather Clan has the privilege of catching clouds and riding rainbows like true knights of the skies.

The sensation of gazing up is one without equal. No obstacles in sight, only a vast plain of emptiness through which humanity yearns to soar, slaking its thirst for a life free of earthly shackles.

But the fires of war spread ever beneath their feet, followed by cries for help. Even a Qucusaur, once wounded, is forced to descend to the earth.

Ifa, then, is the knight whose eyes never leave the ground, out of both duty and habit.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ifa%2FProfile', 'A vet from the Flower-Feather Clan, beloved by humans and animals alike. The round creature by his side is his assistant.

In the eyes of the Natlanese, the Flower-Feather Clan lives in the sky. Although the Scions of the Canopy bound between their cliffs, and the Masters of the Night-Wind stargaze from their summits, only the Flower-Feather Clan has the privilege of catching clouds and riding rainbows like true knights of the skies.

The sensation of gazing up is one without equal. No obstacles in sight, only a vast plain of emptiness through which humanity yearns to soar, slaking its thirst for a life free of earthly shackles.

But the fires of war spread ever beneath their feet, followed by cries for help. Even a Qucusaur, once wounded, is forced to descend to the earth.

Ifa, then, is the knight whose eyes never leave the ground, out of both duty and habit.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ifa%2FProfile', 'Un veterinario del Clan Flor y Pluma, querido por igual por personas y animales. La criatura redonda que lo acompaña es su ayudante.

A ojos de los natlanenses, el Clan Flor y Pluma vive en el cielo. Aunque los Vástagos del Dosel saltan entre sus riscos y los Maestros del Viento Nocturno contemplan las estrellas desde las cumbres, solo el Clan Flor y Pluma tiene el privilegio de atrapar nubes y cabalgar arcoíris como auténticos caballeros del firmamento.

La sensación de mirar hacia arriba no tiene igual. Ningún obstáculo a la vista, solo una vasta llanura de vacío por la que la humanidad ansía volar, saciando su sed de una vida libre de ataduras terrenales.

Pero el fuego de la guerra se extiende sin descanso bajo sus pies, seguido de gritos de auxilio. Incluso un qucusaurio, una vez herido, se ve obligado a descender a tierra.

Ifa es, por tanto, el caballero que nunca aparta la mirada del suelo, por deber y por costumbre.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ifa%2FProfile', true, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101250.png","nombre":"Pata de saurio","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101250.png","nombre":"Pata de saurio","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113072.png","nombre":"Núcleo inerte magmadracónico","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101250.png","nombre":"Pata de saurio","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113072.png","nombre":"Núcleo inerte magmadracónico","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101250.png","nombre":"Pata de saurio","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_1