In addition to keeping the city and the surrounding travel routes safe from the threat of wild monsters, the Knights'' most important responsibility is maintaining order among Mondstadt''s inhabitants.

Mondstadt is the City of Freedom, but unchecked freedom without any kind of rules only invites chaos and anxiety.

Jean''s understanding of this is the reason she remains diligent at all times, holding herself to impeccable standards.

However, she often finds that she exhausts her monthly quota of coffee within the first few days of the month as a result.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Jean%2FProfile', 'La justa y rigurosa Caballera de Dandelion, y Gran Maestra Intendente de los Caballeros de Favonius de Mondstadt.

Jean, la Gran Maestra Intendente de los Caballeros de Favonius, siempre se ha dedicado religiosamente a sus tareas dentro de la orden y al mantenimiento de la paz en Mondstadt. A pesar de no tener grandes talentos, su gran diligencia la han convertido en uno de los miembros con más influencia. Cuando Stormterror amenaza la ciudad, toma medidas rápidamente y protege Mondstadt con todas sus fuerzas.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Jean%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100057.png","nombre":"Semilla de diente de león","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100057.png","nombre":"Semilla de diente de león","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113001.png","nombre":"Semilla de huracán","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100057.png","nombre":"Semilla de diente de león","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112006.png","nombre":"Máscara sucia","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113001.png","nombre":"Semilla de huracán","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100057.png",