  ('gi-kaveh', 'genshin-impact', 'Kaveh', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Kaveh.png', '4', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'DPS / Support', null, null, false, 'A renowned architect from Sumeru who perhaps cares a bit too much about too many things. He is an aesthete troubled by reality.

In a land brimming with as much talent as Sumeru, one is practically spoiled for choice when it comes to designers. But when one speaks of architects, few are those who will not subconsciously think of "Kaveh."
The Kshahrewar graduate was once named the greatest architect in several decades and is known as the Light of Kshahrewar. Kaveh himself, however, is unfortunately unmoved by this title.

Such lovely names and titles are, to him, acknowledgment and shackles both. For example, Kaveh''s insolvency remains a matter of shame for him to this day. A person with little to no standing could just admit to such a thing, but a famous architect cannot. In fact, such undue candor might result in a crisis of reputation for him.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kaveh%2FProfile', 'A renowned architect from Sumeru who perhaps cares a bit too much about too many things. He is an aesthete troubled by reality.

In a land brimming with as much talent as Sumeru, one is practically spoiled for choice when it comes to designers. But when one speaks of architects, few are those who will not subconsciously think of "Kaveh."
The Kshahrewar graduate was once named the greatest architect in several decades and is known as the Light of Kshahrewar. Kaveh himself, however, is unfortunately unmoved by this title.

Such lovely names and titles are, to him, acknowledgment and shackles both. For example, Kaveh''s insolvency remains a matter of shame for him to this day. A person with little to no standing could just admit to such a thing, but a famous architect cannot. In fact, such undue candor might result in a crisis of reputation for him.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kaveh%2FProfile', 'Un célebre arquitecto de Sumeru que se preocupa demasiado por las cosas. Es un fanático de la estética, pero está atrapado por la realidad.

Kaveh es el reconocido arquitecto detrás del Palacio Alcazarzaray y el puente de Puerto Ormos, entre otros proyectos. Se graduó de la la Facultad Kshahrewar de la Akademiya de Sumeru con honores. Enseñó una asignatura optativa de arquitectura mientras estaba en la Akademiya y recibió un estipendio de la Akademiya.

A pesar de que el palacio era su obra maestra, Kaveh terminó endeudado después de su construcción debido a que Dori le prestó una gran cantidad de Mora, lo que lo obligó a establecer su residencia con Alhacén, aunque a menudo discute con su compañero de casa debido a su opiniones muy diferentes. También está familiarizado con Cyno y Tignari.

En algún momento antes del comienzo de las Misiones de Arconte de Sumeru, a Kaveh se le encomendó un proyecto en el desierto.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Kaveh%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101223.png","nombre":"Flor funeraria","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101223.png","nombre":"Flor funeraria","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113040.png","nombre":"Trepadora supresora","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101223.png","nombre":"Flor funeraria","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113040.png","nombre":"Trepadora supresora","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101223.png","nombre":"Flor funeraria","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta