  ('gi-kuki-shinobu', 'genshin-impact', 'Kuki Shinobu', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Shinobu.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer) / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'The deputy leader of the Arataki Gang. She wears a unique mask and is rather stoic. Few people know why a talent of this caliber would run away to join a street gang. Even fewer people know what she hides under her mask.

In the Arataki Gang, where swaggering commotion is something of an aesthetic, the ever-masked and low-key Kuki Shinobu, the gang''s second-in-command, stands out all the more against the backdrop of the other, more clamorous members.

No matter what sort of mess the others have gotten themselves into, this deputy is often able to solve their problems in a manner that is both professional and highly efficient.

Making some snacks for children who had theirs snatched away, giving scratched lacquerware a new coat of paint, and serving as an advocate for detained comrades...

Such are her skills that onlookers often wonder if there is anything that she cannot do.

"I wouldn''t say that I''m certified for everything.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kuki%20Shinobu%2FProfile', 'The deputy leader of the Arataki Gang. She wears a unique mask and is rather stoic. Few people know why a talent of this caliber would run away to join a street gang. Even fewer people know what she hides under her mask.

In the Arataki Gang, where swaggering commotion is something of an aesthetic, the ever-masked and low-key Kuki Shinobu, the gang''s second-in-command, stands out all the more against the backdrop of the other, more clamorous members.

No matter what sort of mess the others have gotten themselves into, this deputy is often able to solve their problems in a manner that is both professional and highly efficient.

Making some snacks for children who had theirs snatched away, giving scratched lacquerware a new coat of paint, and serving as an advocate for detained comrades...

Such are her skills that onlookers often wonder if there is anything that she cannot do.

"I wouldn''t say that I''m certified for everything.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kuki%20Shinobu%2FProfile', 'La hábil y confiable subjefa de la Banda de Arataki. Menos mal que está ella, si no, la Banda de Arataki no tendría nada de “hábil” ni “confiable”.

Aunque Kuki Shinobu se unió a la Banda de Arataki en una etapa posterior, es una figura poderosa que transformó a toda la banda. Después de su llegada, el alcance comercial de la banda se expandió a todos los ámbitos de la vida, incluidos, consultas legales, negociaciones comerciales, servicio para banquetes, personalización de ropa, entre otros...

Lo que es aún más sorprendente es que la displicente Banda de Arataki pudo producir todos los certificados de práctica relevantes, todos firmados con el mismo nombre: Kuki Shinobu.

Se dice que esta segunda al mando había estudiado en el extranjero, y también se dice que tiene afiliaciones cercanas con la Comisión Tenryou.

Cuando los extraños escuchan esto, inevitablemente tienen muchas sospechas.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Kuki%20Shinobu%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112055.png","nombre":"Núcleo espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101205.png","nombre":"Percibetormentas","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104144.png","nombre":"Amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112055.png","nombre":"Núcleo espectral","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-layla', 'genshin-impact', 'Laila (Layla)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Layla.png', '4', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Tanque', null, null, false, 'A Rtawahist student who always looks sleep-deprived. Her dark eye circles have been worsening due to academic stress. Yet no matter how difficult the work at hand, she always manages to make the most brilliant deductions. Could she be writing her thesis in her dreams?

The Rtawahist Darshan of the six Darshans under the Sumeru Akademiya is dedicated to the study of Illuminationism.

Each of the Six Darshans focuses on a different field of study. Illuminationism, then, is centered around astrology and astronomy, learning of the cosmos that has clutched the world in its embrace since time immemorial.

It is among the researchers of Illuminationism that we find Layla.

Though she has only recently enrolled, she has already earned a great many nicknames for herself.

She has been called the Sleepwalking Eccentric, the Human Calculator, and even the Heaven-Sent Thesis by those who know her.

As the days go by, her titles only seem to grow in number.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Layla%2FProfile', 'A Rtawahist student who always looks sleep-deprived. Her dark eye circles have been worsening due to academic stress. Yet no matter how difficult the work at hand, she always manages to make the most brilliant deductions. Could she be writing her thesis in her dreams?

The Rtawahist Darshan of the six Darshans under the Sumeru Akademiya is dedicated to the study of Illuminationism.

Each of the Six Darshans focuses on a different field of study. Illuminationism, then, is centered around astrology and astronomy, learning of the cosmos that has clutched the world in its embrace since time immemorial.

It is among the researchers of Illuminationism that we find Layla.

Though she has only recently enrolled, she has already earned a great many nicknames for herself.

She has been called the Sleepwalking Eccentric, the Human Calculator, and even the Heaven-Sent Thesis by those who know her.

As the days go by, her titles only seem to grow in number.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Layla%2FProfile', '"Siempre dice que está abrumada escribiendo su tesis y que dibujar mapas astrales la estresa, pero es más resistente que nadie, y se niega a quedarse atrás... ¿Por qué la conozco tan bien? Jeje..."
Estudiante de la Facultad Rtawahist, Laila se está especializando en astrología teórica y dibuja incansablemente mapas astrales que incluir en su tesis.

Debido a las altas expectativas de sus profesores, su escritorio siempre está cubierto de montones de papeles que no dejan de crecer por más que se esfuerce.

Al sufrir de una severa falta de sueño, si detiene la mirada fijamente sobre un papel en blanco, montones de estrellas comenzarán a titilar frente a sus ojos.

Es por eso que decidió tomarse un pequeño descanso, para ser capaz de afrontar la realidad con una mente lúcida y despejada.

Cuando abrió los ojos de nuevo, descubrió que una miríada de estrellas habían adornado el manuscrito que previamente dejó en blanco.

Laila se frotó los ojos para asegurarse de que no estaba soñando.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Laila%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":8}]},{