  ('gi-lan-yan', 'genshin-impact', 'Lan Yan', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Lanyan.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Support / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'A key member of the Chenyu Vale Artisans Association, she is adept at weaving a dazzling array of rattan handicrafts, and her joyful, quick-witted nature is positively infectious.

When it comes time for the residents of Chenyu Vale to spruce up their homes, there is more than just the usual panoply of intricately carved wooden beds and tables on offer.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lan%20Yan%2FProfile', 'A key member of the Chenyu Vale Artisans Association, she is adept at weaving a dazzling array of rattan handicrafts, and her joyful, quick-witted nature is positively infectious.

When it comes time for the residents of Chenyu Vale to spruce up their homes, there is more than just the usual panoply of intricately carved wooden beds and tables on offer.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lan%20Yan%2FProfile', 'Una tejedora de mimbre procedente del Valle Chenyu. Tiene una mente clara, templada, y es ágil como el manantial de una montaña.

(Por añadir...)', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lan%20Yan%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","nombre":"Néctar brillante","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","nombre":"Néctar brillante","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fu