  ('gi-lauma', 'genshin-impact', 'Lauma', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Lauma.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'The Moonchanter of the Frostmoon Scions, also known as the Maiden of the Grove. She has a peculiar affinity for both animals and the moonlight.

When night falls, the Frostmoon Scions dwell within a "tower."

At the top of this tower is a seemingly unchanging full moon, and at its base is the soil of Hiisi Island. Its walls are made of white moonlight, allowing any to pass through.

Oh, how gentle the Moon Goddess is. Even if not all should believe in her, even if not all should know of her, she spreads her grace without reserve.

Thus spoke the old priestess of the Frostmoon Scions.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lauma%2FProfile', 'The Moonchanter of the Frostmoon Scions, also known as the Maiden of the Grove. She has a peculiar affinity for both animals and the moonlight.

When night falls, the Frostmoon Scions dwell within a "tower."

At the top of this tower is a seemingly unchanging full moon, and at its base is the soil of Hiisi Island. Its walls are made of white moonlight, allowing any to pass through.

Oh, how gentle the Moon Goddess is. Even if not all should believe in her, even if not all should know of her, she spreads her grace without reserve.

Thus spoke the old priestess of the Frostmoon Scions.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lauma%2FProfile', '"Bajo la atenta protección de nuestra bondadosa Cantalunas, ningún humano o bestia inocente resultará herido... *Suspira*, pero cuando la ley del más fuerte ya no está en pie, algunas bestias carnívoras lo pasarán mal y querrán probar bocado".

A pesar de ser los habitantes originales de la tierra en la que viven, los Descendientes Lunaescarcha parecen no encajar con la Nod Krai de hoy en día. 
Son una comunidad muy antigua, de ideas muy rígidas y con una fe demasiado arraigada en la adoración a una deidad que nunca han visto. 
Creen que las sombras de las arboledas son su refugio, y que la esplendorosa luz lunar hará desaparecer todas sus dolencias y aflicciones. 
Rezan a la luna, siempre con una pregunta: "Oh, gran Diosa de la Luna Escarchada, ¿cuándo responderá a nuestras plegarias?". 
Al no obtener respuesta, vuelven a preguntar: "Oh, venerable Cantalunas, ¿cuándo responderá la Diosa Lunar a nuestras plegarias?".', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lauma%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113078.png","nombre":"Ala rutilante","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113078.png","nombre":"Ala rutilante","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113078.png","nombre":"Ala rutilante","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113078.png","nombre":"Ala rutilante","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104134.png","nombre":"Esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113078.png","nombre":"Ala rutilante","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-linnea', 'genshin-impact', 'Linnea', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/a9/Linnea_Icon.png', '5', 'Geo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Advisor for the Adventurers'' Guild, a changeling, born of the fae but raised among humans.

Of the Adventurers'' Guild''s many advisors, Linnea is, without a doubt, the most special one of them all. Though she bears the title of "advisor," she is less a scholar before a desk and more a perpetual wanderer on the road. This is because for her, the world''s heartbeat can only be felt out in the wild, by walking untamed lands and measuring the earth with her own two feet, and by beholding its wonders with her very own eyes.

This unwavering devotion to fieldwork has made her a master of survival. Out in the wild, she is able to identify hundreds of plants through the seasons, as well as track many a rare beast using nothing but tracks in the earth and scents in the wind.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Linnea%2FProfile', 'Advisor for the Adventurers'' Guild, a changeling, born of the fae but raised among humans.

Of the Adventurers'' Guild''s many advisors, Linnea is, without a doubt, the most special one of them all. Though she bears the title of "advisor," she is less a scholar before a desk and more a perpetual wanderer on the road. This is because for her, the world''s heartbeat can only be felt out in the wild, by walking untamed lands and measuring the earth with her own two feet, and by beholding its wonders with her very own eyes.

This unwavering devotion to fieldwork has made her a master of survival. Out in the wild, she is able to identify hundreds of plants through the seasons, as well as track many a rare beast using nothing but tracks in the earth and scents in the wind.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Linnea%2FProfile', 'Creía que los trucos de los niños cambiados se habían convertido en leyenda tras el fin del gobierno de las hadas, hasta que un día, después de una función, conocí a esa vivaz aventurera... la cual me trajo maravillosos sonidos de distintas criaturas de todos los rincones del mundo. ¡Ella sí que es interesante, no como esos viejos cascarrabias de la tundra!Al principio, los niños que nacen en este mundo siempre se consideran a sí mismos el centro del universo. Darse cuenta de la brecha que existe entre uno mismo y el mundo suele marcar el fin de la infancia. Pero ¿qué ocurre cuando dicho niño es una criatura no humana que vive en la sociedad humana? Para ese niño, el camino hacia la madurez probablemente sea mucho más amargo. Aunque esta sea Nod Krai, el paraíso de los monstruos y los excéntricos...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Linn%C3%A9a%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104174.png","nombre":"Topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-lisa', 'genshin-impact', 'Lisa', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Lisa.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Debuffer', null, null, false, 'She is an intellectual witch who can never get enough naps. As the Librarian of the Knights of Favonius, Lisa is smart in that she always knows exactly what to do with whatever troubles her. As much as she loves her sleep, she still manages to keep everything under control in a calm, composed manner.

The librarian of the Knights of Favonius. In addition to her elegance and charm, Lisa is also highly educated.

She is said to have been the most talented sorceress to study at the Sumeru Akademiya in the last two centuries.

It is known that Lisa chose to return to Mondstadt after two years of advanced study in Sumeru, but the reason for her decision is not. At present, Lisa''s job is to oversee the book collection in the library owned by the Knights.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lisa%2FProfile', 'She is an intellectual witch who can never get enough naps. As the Librarian of the Knights of Favonius, Lisa is smart in that she always knows exactly what to do with whatever troubles her. As much as she loves her sleep, she still manages to keep everything under control in a calm, composed manner.

The librarian of the Knights of Favonius. In addition to her elegance and charm, Lisa is also highly educated.

She is said to have been the most talented sorceress to study at the Sumeru Akademiya in the last two centuries.

It is known that Lisa chose to return to Mondstadt after two years of advanced study in Sumeru, but the reason for her decision is not. At present, Lisa''s job is to oversee the book collection in the library owned by the Knights.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lisa%2FProfile', 'Lisa es una bruja muy inteligente con una gran afición por la siesta. Ella es la bibliotecaria de la Orden, siempre encuentra en los libros la mejor solución a los problemas. Aunque parezca perezosa, no teme a nada y mantiene todo bajo control
La perezosa pero sabia bibliotecaria de los Caballeros de Favonius. En realidad, fue considerada por la Academia de Sumeru como su graduada más sobresaliente en los últimos dos siglos.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lisa%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104144.png","nombre":"Amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113002.png","nombre":"Prisma del relámpago","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-lohen', 'genshin-impact', 'Lohen', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/86/Lohen_Icon.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Vice Captain of the Knights of Favonius 5th Company. A young knight who fights on the front lines, using himself as the arrow and his spear as its tip.

Barely had the expeditionary force begun its journey home when the bards were already on their way, carrying the heroes'' stories back to the taverns.

Even amid familiar names like Varka, the title "Frontline Suppression Officer" had started to command attention, recognized for both remarkable accomplishments and constant engagement in battle.

How could a long-range troop — meant to strike from afar — always find itself at the very front, charging straight into hand-to-hand combat with blades ready?

Why would a squad armed with crossbows and muskets follow a young knight wielding only a spear?

Such contradictions naturally drew questions, and where questions lingered, debate quickly followed.

Some could not hide their irritation: "So because they close in, their ranged attacks suddenly fail?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lohen%2FProfile', 'Vice Captain of the Knights of Favonius 5th Company. A young knight who fights on the front lines, using himself as the arrow and his spear as its tip.

Barely had the expeditionary force begun its journey home when the bards were already on their way, carrying the heroes'' stories back to the taverns.

Even amid familiar names like Varka, the title "Frontline Suppression Officer" had started to command attention, recognized for both remarkable accomplishments and constant engagement in battle.

How could a long-range troop — meant to strike from afar — always find itself at the very front, charging straight into hand-to-hand combat with blades ready?

Why would a squad armed with crossbows and muskets follow a young knight wielding only a spear?

Such contradictions naturally drew questions, and where questions lingered, debate quickly followed.

Some could not hide their irritation: "So because they close in, their ranged attacks suddenly fail?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lohen%2FProfile', '"Soy muy consciente de su decisión y sus preocupaciones sobre muchos de nuestros compañeros. Contar con un caballero así en la expedición cubriría ciertas de las limitaciones de nuestras fuerzas. La única pregunta es: ¿cómo voy a poder mantenerlos vigilados a ambos a la vez?".
Aunque Lohen es el Subcapitán de la Compañía de Ofensiva a Distancia, rara vez usa el arco.

Quienes viajan con él por primera vez siempre se quedan anonadados de que, cuando los demás miembros del escuadrón aún están en formación en la retaguardia con sus ballestas y mosquetes, el joven caballero, que debería estar buscando refugio, ya ha atravesado la línea de defensa, lanza en mano, para enfrentarse a los enemigos más peligrosos.

Los caballeros que alguna vez han preguntado el porqué a los miembros de la Compañía de Ofensiva a Distancia suelen recibir dos respuestas:

"Mientras Lohen esté en el frente, ningún enemigo será capaz de acercarse y todos podremos proporcionarle apoyo de fuego sin preocuparnos de na', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lohen%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112011.png","nombre":"Flecha robusta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113085.png","nombre":"Cola prismática cortada","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113085.png","nombre":"Cola prismática cortada","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101272.png","nombre":"Polilla alaetérea","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112012.png","nombre":"Flecha afilada","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https: