  ('gi-lynette', 'genshin-impact', 'Lynette', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Linette.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Support', null, null, false, 'A magician''s assistant hidden in the shadows who refers to herself as a "Multi-Function Magic Assistant." Poker-faced, reticent to speak, and as unpredictable in her movements as a cat.

When asked who the most famous magician in the Court of Fontaine is, audiences will almost certainly think of the stylish, vibrant Lyney and his stage presence.

But if you were to ask after its most renowned magic assistant, people would scratch their hands and be at quite a loss to answer.

The adulation is not for her, after all, nor is the resounding applause directed at her skill and presence. As an assistant, she needs only misdirect the audience at opportune moments, ensuring the spotlight stays on the protagonist.

Whether on or offstage, Lynette habitually hides behind Lyney, in shadows that neither lights nor compliments can penetrate.

For an assistant, keeping a low profile is a professional matter.

And as for a child of the "House"... being cloaked in shadow is how one survives.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lynette%2FProfile', 'A magician''s assistant hidden in the shadows who refers to herself as a "Multi-Function Magic Assistant." Poker-faced, reticent to speak, and as unpredictable in her movements as a cat.

When asked who the most famous magician in the Court of Fontaine is, audiences will almost certainly think of the stylish, vibrant Lyney and his stage presence.

But if you were to ask after its most renowned magic assistant, people would scratch their hands and be at quite a loss to answer.

The adulation is not for her, after all, nor is the resounding applause directed at her skill and presence. As an assistant, she needs only misdirect the audience at opportune moments, ensuring the spotlight stays on the protagonist.

Whether on or offstage, Lynette habitually hides behind Lyney, in shadows that neither lights nor compliments can penetrate.

For an assistant, keeping a low profile is a professional matter.

And as for a child of the "House"... being cloaked in shadow is how one survives.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lynette%2FProfile', 'Una ayudante de magia poco habladora y expresiva. Es tan impredecible como un felino.

En comparación con sus hermanos Lyney y Fréminet, Lynette es la más reservada de los tres. Rara vez habla con los demás por su propia voluntad, dejando que Lyney hable por ella, y disuade esencialmente cualquier intento de hablar con ella diciendo respuestas extrañas. Cuando necesita hablar, lo hace de forma breve y franca.

Debido a tener sangre felina, Lynette tiene muchos rasgos similares a los de un gato, como disfrutar del pescado. También tiene la costumbre de romper o estropear las máquinas, por lo que no las utiliza con frecuencia. A Lynette le gusta preparar y beber té.

Como resultado de su traumático pasado con Lyney, Lynette no confía en la mayoría de la gente para que no se aprovechen de ella, viendo a su hermano como una verdad en un mundo lleno de mentiras y falsedades.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lynette%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112085.png","nombre":"Engranaje mecadinámico","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101235.png","nombre":"Campanilla lumidulce","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104154.png","nombre":"Turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112085.png","nombre":"Engranaje mecadinámico","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113049.png","nombre":"Recambio mecánico de Coppélia","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-lyney', 'genshin-impact', 'Lyney', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Liney.png', '5', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'A genius of a magician famed throughout Fontaine. He moves his audience with a combination of sleight of hand and the gift of the gab. Eloquent, ingenious, and with a mind as hard to fathom as a cat.

The people of Fontaine love their tales of mystery. The intricate case setups and unexpected twists and turns are captivating for all.

Magic recreates this experience under the converging spotlights. For the price of a ticket and some of your free time, you can embark on a wondrous journey amidst thunderous applause and astounded cries.

If you were to ask around as to which of Fontaine''s "guides" is best at setting up such fantastical tours, most fans will tell you that it is Lyney.

Suave, romantic, and talented, he performs miracle after miracle with a casual air.

In this industry, one needs only a stable of staple tricks to ensure a renowned reputation and comfortable life.

However, Lyney''s shows always feature some new trick.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lyney%2FProfile', 'A genius of a magician famed throughout Fontaine. He moves his audience with a combination of sleight of hand and the gift of the gab. Eloquent, ingenious, and with a mind as hard to fathom as a cat.

The people of Fontaine love their tales of mystery. The intricate case setups and unexpected twists and turns are captivating for all.

Magic recreates this experience under the converging spotlights. For the price of a ticket and some of your free time, you can embark on a wondrous journey amidst thunderous applause and astounded cries.

If you were to ask around as to which of Fontaine''s "guides" is best at setting up such fantastical tours, most fans will tell you that it is Lyney.

Suave, romantic, and talented, he performs miracle after miracle with a casual air.

In this industry, one needs only a stable of staple tricks to ensure a renowned reputation and comfortable life.

However, Lyney''s shows always feature some new trick.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lyney%2FProfile', 'Un astuto y hábil mago de Fontaine que siempre se gana al público con sus ingeniosos trucos y su elocuencia.

"A veces desvía la atención con pequeños gestos, otras finge equivocarse y te muestra un error... Cuando la cosa se pone seria, los juegos de manos son más deslumbrantes que la propia magia. ¿Adivinas de qué estoy hablando?".

A excepción de los juicios que se celebran en la Ópera de la Epíclesis, los espectáculos de magia de Lyney y Lynette son sin duda lo mejor de la Corte de Fontaine. Un juicio utiliza la verdad para impartir justicia. La magia utiliza las apariencias para conmover al público. Aunque el público sabía perfectamente que todo lo que había en el escenario no era más que trucos e ilusiones, se siguen sorprendiendo cuando presencian un "milagro". La atronadora ovación del público llegaba incluso antes de que el telón se bajara elegantemente ante el mago. En el escenario, Lyney es el gran mago esperado por todos.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Lyney%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113051.png","nombre":"Providencia imperial","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113051.png","nombre":"Providencia imperial","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113051.png","nombre":"Providencia imperial","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113051.png","nombre":"Providencia imperial","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101236.png","nombre":"Rosarcoíris","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104114.png","nombre":"Ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113051.png","nombre":"Providencia imperial","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-mavuika', 'genshin-impact', 'Mavuika (Arconte Pyro)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Mavuika.png', '5', 'Pyro', 90, null, 'DPS / Buffer', null, null, false, 'Natlan''s Archon and leader, the everlasting flame of hope for all living beings, and the cleansing flame that incinerates all evil.

When the name "Mavuika" is mentioned, the citizens of Natlan will not be stingy with their praise, for she has proven herself well-qualified and worthy of respect, be it as a leader or Archon.

She is the pinnacle of strength in Natlan, and she has the bearing to match. Even newly-arrived travelers need only hear her speak at the Stadium of the Sacred Flame to know that she merits being known as the sun.

She is exceedingly awe-inspiring, but is no unsmiling ruler whose ways may as well be set in stone.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mavuika%2FProfile', 'Natlan''s Archon and leader, the everlasting flame of hope for all living beings, and the cleansing flame that incinerates all evil.

When the name "Mavuika" is mentioned, the citizens of Natlan will not be stingy with their praise, for she has proven herself well-qualified and worthy of respect, be it as a leader or Archon.

She is the pinnacle of strength in Natlan, and she has the bearing to match. Even newly-arrived travelers need only hear her speak at the Stadium of the Sacred Flame to know that she merits being known as the sun.

She is exceedingly awe-inspiring, but is no unsmiling ruler whose ways may as well be set in stone.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mavuika%2FProfile', 'La líder de Natlan que heredó el nombre antiguo de “Kiongozi”. Ella se comprometió a iluminar el futuro de la Nación de la Guerra con el Fuego Sagrado.

Mavuika es la figura más venerada en todo Natlan, y se ha convertido en la ídolo de todos los guerreros de la nación. Fue elegida Arconte en el Peregrinaje del Retorno del Fuego Sagrado hace cientos de años, y, como tal, ahora porta la Gnosis, que es la fuente de su poder como Arconte y de su inmortalidad. Antes de convertirse en Arconte era parte de la tribu de los Retoños arbóreos, donde pasó su infancia y juventud junto a sus padres, su hermana Hine y su amigo Burkina, quien más tarde sería un gran guerrero de la tribu . Después de eso, perdió el contacto con sus seres queridos para dedicarse a su nación.

Su grandeza emocionó a Kachina cuando la diosa la llamó "heroína de Natlan", expresando que jamás habría soñado con tal honor.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Mavuika%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112105.png","nombre":"Silbato de hierro del guerrero","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112105.png","nombre":"Silbato de hierro del guerrero","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112106.png","nombre":"Silbato de oro del soldado sauriocoronado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101253.png","nombre":"Purpuflor chamuscada","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104114.png","nombre":"Ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112106.png","nombre":"Silbato de oro del soldado sauriocoronado","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113066.png","nombre":"Núcleo fuentenigmático con grabados de oro","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-mika', 'genshin-impact', 'Mika', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Mika.png', '4', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Buffer / Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'A young knight who is a key member of the front-line scouting team. Quiet and unassuming, Mika treats every task seriously, and can cook up a mean serving of field rations. However, he can''t seem to hide his bashful and shy personality when meeting strangers.

Whenever he shows up at the Knights of Favonius headquarters, Mika always swiftly finishes any discussions to be had with his fellow knights, then quietly slips away to avoid becoming a hindrance to others'' work.

Mika always gets nervous when someone strikes up a conversation with him, frantically scampering away right after politely putting an end to the idle chatter.

The knights know that the young man''s name is Mika, and that he is Huffman''s younger brother and the second son of the Schmidt family.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mika%2FProfile', 'A young knight who is a key member of the front-line scouting team. Quiet and unassuming, Mika treats every task seriously, and can cook up a mean serving of field rations. However, he can''t seem to hide his bashful and shy personality when meeting strangers.

Whenever he shows up at the Knights of Favonius headquarters, Mika always swiftly finishes any discussions to be had with his fellow knights, then quietly slips away to avoid becoming a hindrance to others'' work.

Mika always gets nervous when someone strikes up a conversation with him, frantically scampering away right after politely putting an end to the idle chatter.

The knights know that the young man''s name is Mika, and that he is Huffman''s younger brother and the second son of the Schmidt family.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mika%2FProfile', 'Un joven caballero procedente de una familia normal. Es el tímido y precavido topógrafo de avanzada de la Compañía de Reconocimiento.

Mika es el hermano menor de Huffman. También es miembro de la Compañía de Reconocimiento de Eula. Medio año antes de la llegada del Viajero a Mondstadt, Mika fue con el grupo de expedición de Varka para ayudar a explorarlos. Antes del comienzo del Festival de la Vendimia, Varka envió a Mika de vuelta a Mondstadt con una carta para que la dirigiera a los Caballeros que quedaban en la nación y los pusiera al corriente de los progresos del grupo. Mika se dirigió al grupo y leyó el contenido de la carta antes de volver a ponerse al día con sus viejos amigos de la Compañía de Reconocimiento.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Mika%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104164.png","nombre":"Jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112034.png","nombre":"Insignia del oficial","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113044.png","nombre":"Pseudoestambre","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-mizuki', 'genshin-impact', 'Mizuki', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Mizuki.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'A yumekui-baku, who also happens to be a clinical psychologist and a major shareholder of Aisa Bathhouse. If you ever find yourself gripped by seemingly insurmountable anxiety, she will surely be able to offer you the help you so need.

Mention the Aisa Bathhouse, and for most Inazumans, the first thing that springs to mind are its artificial hot springs — inspired by those present in Natlan, kitted out with imported facilities, and hailed as a "go-to destination for relaxation."

The bathhouse has recently undergone a major renovation, now offering "psychotherapy" services that have quickly won it widespread acclaim.

Enter Yumemizuki Mizuki, a clinical psychologist who, after having only recently returned to Inazuma, has quickly taken center stage.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mizuki%2FProfile', 'A yumekui-baku, who also happens to be a clinical psychologist and a major shareholder of Aisa Bathhouse. If you ever find yourself gripped by seemingly insurmountable anxiety, she will surely be able to offer you the help you so need.

Mention the Aisa Bathhouse, and for most Inazumans, the first thing that springs to mind are its artificial hot springs — inspired by those present in Natlan, kitted out with imported facilities, and hailed as a "go-to destination for relaxation."

The bathhouse has recently undergone a major renovation, now offering "psychotherapy" services that have quickly won it widespread acclaim.

Enter Yumemizuki Mizuki, a clinical psychologist who, after having only recently returned to Inazuma, has quickly taken center stage.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mizuki%2FProfile', 'Una yumekui-baku que además es psicóloga clínica y accionista mayoritaria de los Baños Aisa. Si alguna vez te ves atrapado por una angustia que parece insuperable, seguro que ella sabrá darte la ayuda que necesitas.

Si mencionas los Baños Aisa, lo primero que le viene a la cabeza a la mayoría de los habitantes de Inazuma son sus aguas termales artificiales, inspiradas en las de Natlan, equipadas con instalaciones importadas y consideradas un "destino de referencia para relajarse".

El establecimiento ha pasado hace poco por una gran reforma y ahora ofrece servicios de "psicoterapia" que han cosechado enseguida un aplauso generalizado.

Y ahí entra Yumemizuki Mizuki, una psicóloga clínica que, pese a haber regresado a Inazuma hace muy poco, ha pasado rápidamente a ocupar el centro del escenario.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mizuki%2FProfile', true, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112044.png","nombre":"Guardamano viejo","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112044.png","nombre":"Guardamano viejo","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112045.png","nombre":"Guardamano gemelo","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112045.png","nombre":"Guardamano gemelo","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112046.png","nombre":"Guardamano célebre","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101206.png","nombre":"Hongo marino","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104154.png","nombre":"Turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112046.png","nombre":"Guardamano célebre","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113071.png","nombre":"Talismán de la tierra enigmática","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-mona', 'genshin-impact', 'Mona', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Mona.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Buffer / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'A mysterious young astrologer who proclaims herself to be "Astrologist Mona Megistus," and who possesses abilities to match the title. Erudite, but prideful. Though she is often strapped for cash and lives a life of thrift, she is resolved to never use astrology for profit... It is this very resolution that has caused her to constantly fret about money.

Teyvat is a place where people of all sorts go about their business. Merchants move products, knights patrol, and farmers till the land.

But if one were to ask Mona — the enigmatic and prideful astrologist — what she busies herself with, she will reply by saying that she is servicing a debt known as "life."

She will, however, vigorously deny being "poor," giving the following explanation:

"Beautiful veneers may obscure simple truths.

Exquisite food may mask its nutritional value.

One lives simply, all the better to expose this world''s truths."

A frugal lifestyle, therefore, is a form of training to access the truth...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mona%2FProfile', 'A mysterious young astrologer who proclaims herself to be "Astrologist Mona Megistus," and who possesses abilities to match the title. Erudite, but prideful. Though she is often strapped for cash and lives a life of thrift, she is resolved to never use astrology for profit... It is this very resolution that has caused her to constantly fret about money.

