  ('gi-mualani', 'genshin-impact', 'Mualani', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Mualani.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'One of the shining stars of the People of the Springs'' new generation of young guides. If you''ve come to Natlan for sightseeing, there''s no better companion you could choose.

If any traveler visiting the People of the Springs for the first time wants to try out the popular watersports here, like swimming, surfing, diving, or water polo... Everyone will recommend they go speak with Mualani, without exception.

Mualani operates the Leisurely Puffer, a store that specializes in products related to watersports. Her goods are expertly designed and of superb quality, while she herself has a vast wealth of knowledge in her capacity as a guide.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mualani%2FProfile', 'One of the shining stars of the People of the Springs'' new generation of young guides. If you''ve come to Natlan for sightseeing, there''s no better companion you could choose.

If any traveler visiting the People of the Springs for the first time wants to try out the popular watersports here, like swimming, surfing, diving, or water polo... Everyone will recommend they go speak with Mualani, without exception.

Mualani operates the Leisurely Puffer, a store that specializes in products related to watersports. Her goods are expertly designed and of superb quality, while she herself has a vast wealth of knowledge in her capacity as a guide.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Mualani%2FProfile', 'Si se lo propone a sí misma, para esa muchacha no existe ni un solo rincón de Natlan al que no pueda llegar. Entonces, ¿para qué viene a verme antes de partir queriendo saber si los augurios son buenos o malos? Bueno, le he vaticinado todos los días auspiciosos de la próxima década y parece que se ha quedado más tranquila.
Puede que ni las aves que sobrevuelan estas tierras conozcan Natlan mejor que los guías del Pueblo de los Manantiales. Hace mucho, mucho tiempo, sus ancestros midieron el mundo con sus propios pies y manos, convirtiendo cada una de las sendas retorcidas e intransitables de la región en sencillos trazos de un mapa.

Como miembro de la nueva generación del Pueblo de los Manantiales, la reputación de Mualani como guía se extendió pronto por toda Natlan.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Mualani%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101247.png","nombre":"Branquia plumaespuma","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101247.png","nombre":"Branquia plumaespuma","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112104.png","nombre":"Silbato de madera del guardián","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113064.png","nombre":"Sello de la bendición vinculante","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101247.png","nombre":"Branquia plumaespuma","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112105.png","nombre":"Silbato de hierro del guerrero","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113064.png","nombre":"Sello de la bendición vinculante","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101247.png","nombre":"Branquia plumaespuma","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.m