  ('gi-nahida', 'genshin-impact', 'Nahida (Arconte Dendro)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Nahida.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Buffer', null, null, false, 'Lesser Lord Kusanali dwells deep in the Sanctuary of Surasthana, and has never really been in the limelight, nor has she even been mentioned much. Her burden is heavy, but though she may experience loneliness, and though darkness is all she sees before her, she will not stop moving forward.

Greater Lord Rukkhadevata created Sumeru''s rainforest and bestowed wisdom upon the people of Sumeru through the Akademiya.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nahida%2FProfile', 'Lesser Lord Kusanali dwells deep in the Sanctuary of Surasthana, and has never really been in the limelight, nor has she even been mentioned much. Her burden is heavy, but though she may experience loneliness, and though darkness is all she sees before her, she will not stop moving forward.

Greater Lord Rukkhadevata created Sumeru''s rainforest and bestowed wisdom upon the people of Sumeru through the Akademiya.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nahida%2FProfile', '"Yo diría que o presta mucha atención o es demasiado cariñosa con la gente... Aunque sus acciones puedan ser algo defectuosas, creo que su sentido de la responsabilidad como deidad de Sumeru es algo encomiable. Después de todo, ella es la deidad más joven, no como cierta otra persona que es propensa a la histeria...".

La Reina Menor Kusanali reside en las profundidades del Santuario de Surasthana.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Nahida%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113040.png","nombre":"Trepadora supresora","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113040.png","nombre":"Trepadora supresora","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101217.png","nombre":"Loto kalpa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113040.png","nombre":"Trepadora s