  ('gi-nefer', 'genshin-impact', 'Nefer', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Nefer.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'The incredibly resourceful owner of the Curatorium of Secrets.

Nasha Town is a "bustling" town.

During the day, mercantile debate and reckless arguments can be heard everywhere on the streets.

And at night, whispered schemes and the secret plots of thieves abound in the town''s more dimly lit rooms.

Like a butterfly languidly flitting in the summer, these wild ambitions and intrigues linger soundlessly around every corner.

Countless are those who have chased said butterfly, hoping to one day find a land of plenty and safety.

Meanwhile, the one true feline, the one capable of felling butterflies with a single pounce, crouches high above, gazing down upon those who chase illusions as they furiously clash and clamor, only to fall once more.

"Ashru."

At the sound of his owner''s call, the feline turned his gaze away from those with whom he was not at all concerned.

For no matter how the world changed, his owner would always have tasty dried fish in hand.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nefer%2FProfile', 'The incredibly resourceful owner of the Curatorium of Secrets.

Nasha Town is a "bustling" town.

During the day, mercantile debate and reckless arguments can be heard everywhere on the streets.

And at night, whispered schemes and the secret plots of thieves abound in the town''s more dimly lit rooms.

Like a butterfly languidly flitting in the summer, these wild ambitions and intrigues linger soundlessly around every corner.

Countless are those who have chased said butterfly, hoping to one day find a land of plenty and safety.

Meanwhile, the one true feline, the one capable of felling butterflies with a single pounce, crouches high above, gazing down upon those who chase illusions as they furiously clash and clamor, only to fall once more.

"Ashru."

At the sound of his owner''s call, the feline turned his gaze away from those with whom he was not at all concerned.

For no matter how the world changed, his owner would always have tasty dried fish in hand.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nefer%2FProfile', '"A veces hablo con las serpientes y me cuentan que incluso aquellas con la sangre más fría desean encontrar la rama perfecta en la que enroscarse... Menos mal que en Nod Krai hay árboles de sobra para que todas las serpientes puedan encontrar su propio lugar".

Gracias a su excepcional eficiencia para completar encargos y su precio relativamente bajo (el cual puede regatearse aún más si Jahoda está de servicio), la Cámara de Secretos posee una gran reputación entre los residentes de la Villa Nasha. 
Sea cual sea el encargo, la Cámara de Secretos garantiza poder realizarlo y dejar a sus clientes satisfechos, ya se trate de la búsqueda de un gato, una persona, un objeto, un rastro, un criminal o un amante infiel. 
Uno podría pensar que la Cámara de Secretos y el Gremio de Aventureros, que se encuentran a unas pocas puertas de distancia, son muy similares.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/N%C3%A9fer%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113079.png","nombre":"Asta radiante","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113079.png","nombre":"Asta radiante","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113079.png","nombre":"Asta radiante","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113079.png","nombre":"Asta radiante","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101263.png","nombre":"Plata lunacaída","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104134.png","nombre":"Esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112127.png","nombre":"Distintivo escarchado","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113079.png","nombre":"Asta radiante","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-neuvillette', 'genshin-impact', 'Neuvillette', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Neuvillette.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'You wouldn''t exactly describe the Iudex of Fontaine as "approachable." It''s hard to say whether it''s just in his nature, or because he has secrets to hide.

Neuvillette is a solitary person.

Fontainians who have tried to get close to him have, without exception, been politely rejected. To this day, no one even knows his first name, since he has always asked that he be referred to by his last name.

He believes that close personal ties will lead to suspicions about the justness of one''s judgments, while he must remain a symbol of absolute justice.

Of course, there will always be people who just won''t give up. They will say, "Come now, Monsieur Neuvillette. Not everyone will stand trial, nor will you always have to remain in the judge''s seat."

But is that really the case? If there is an answer in his heart, Neuvillette will not reveal it.

Given enough time, every river will overflow and flood.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Neuvillette%2FProfile', 'You wouldn''t exactly describe the Iudex of Fontaine as "approachable." It''s hard to say whether it''s just in his nature, or because he has secrets to hide.

Neuvillette is a solitary person.

Fontainians who have tried to get close to him have, without exception, been politely rejected. To this day, no one even knows his first name, since he has always asked that he be referred to by his last name.

He believes that close personal ties will lead to suspicions about the justness of one''s judgments, while he must remain a symbol of absolute justice.

Of course, there will always be people who just won''t give up. They will say, "Come now, Monsieur Neuvillette. Not everyone will stand trial, nor will you always have to remain in the judge''s seat."

But is that really the case? If there is an answer in his heart, Neuvillette will not reveal it.

Given enough time, every river will overflow and flood.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Neuvillette%2FProfile', 'La verdadera prueba comenzará el día en que ellos regresen.

"En la anterior edición, su señoría Neuvillette calificó de ''amarillista'' la columna de secretos de la Arconte Hydro, así que esta vez nos centraremos en el enigmático juez supremo. Como sabemos muy poco sobre su auténtica forma de ser y ha rechazado nuestras entrevistas en múltiples ocasiones, decidimos recurrir a la opinión pública para hacernos con el material más verídico posible. En ese sentido, hemos descartado toda carta anónima o cuya veracidad fuera altamente dudosa. A continuación les mostramos una de las cartas más adorables que nos han llegado:

...

''Si de verdad existiera el Héroe Oscuro, ese solo sería un disfraz. Cuando el Héroe Oscuro se levanta por la mañana y se lava los dientes, sigue siendo el mismo, ya que solo adopta esa identidad a medianoche. Sin embargo, Neuvillette (Su Señoría) no es así.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Neuvillette%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112081.png","nombre":"Fragmento extramarino","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112081.png","nombre":"Fragmento extramarino","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre":"Trozo de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112082.png","nombre":"Cristalización cromática","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101237.png","nombre":"Lumistela","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104124.png","nombre":"Lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112082.png","nombre":"Cristalización cromática","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113053.png","nombre":"Cuerno de corcel fontamarino","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-nicole', 'genshin-impact', 'Nicole', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/a0/Nicole_Icon.png', '5', 'Pyro', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Mage N, Nicole Reeyn. In summary: "The observer of the World."

Many of the stories Nicole envisions begin with a phrase as old as the stories themselves: "A long, long time ago..."

It was a time, a long, long, time ago, when the lights of myriad nations filigreed the earth in gleaming gold, when the daughters of heaven wandered in carefree grace betwixt divine courts and mortal cities... It was a time, a long, long, time ago, when the sovereign of ages past, who had descended into deepest darkness, had not yet brought disaster back to his homeland, when the radiant moons that hung aloft in the night heavens were still three...

The years brook no pause, the wheel spinning onward all the same. In a cycle emptied of hope, the spark of paradise perished alongside lives extinguished.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nicole%2FProfile', 'Mage N, Nicole Reeyn. In summary: "The observer of the World."

Many of the stories Nicole envisions begin with a phrase as old as the stories themselves: "A long, long time ago..."

It was a time, a long, long, time ago, when the lights of myriad nations filigreed the earth in gleaming gold, when the daughters of heaven wandered in carefree grace betwixt divine courts and mortal cities... It was a time, a long, long, time ago, when the sovereign of ages past, who had descended into deepest darkness, had not yet brought disaster back to his homeland, when the radiant moons that hung aloft in the night heavens were still three...

The years brook no pause, the wheel spinning onward all the same. In a cycle emptied of hope, the spark of paradise perished alongside lives extinguished.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nicole%2FProfile', '"Editora de burbujas de recuerdos mágicas", "Defensora acérrima de las ardillas", "Persona supercreativa que siempre encuentra una solución"... "¿Alice? ¿Por qué son cada vez más largos los títulos de la fórmula mágica?".
Muchas de las historias visualizadas por Nicole comienzan con la frase "Hace mucho, mucho tiempo...".

Quizás, para algunos escritores, "mucho tiempo" no sea más que una excusa para evitar posibles preguntas.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Nicole%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101269.png","nombre":"Ámbar de pino","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104111.png","nombre":"Pedacito de ágata agnidus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101269.png","nombre":"Ámbar de pino","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113084.png","nombre":"Vestigio de las alas del terror","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101269.png","nombre":"Ámbar de pino","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104112.png","nombre":"Fragmento de ágata agnidus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113084.png","nombre":"Vestigio de las alas del terror","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101269.png","nombre":"Ámbar de pino","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104113.png","nombre":"Trozo de ágata agnidus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://g