  ('gi-noelle', 'genshin-impact', 'Noelle', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Noel.png', '4', 'Geo', 90, null, 'Tanque / Support (Healer) / DPS', null, null, false, 'Like most of Mondstadt''s young people, Noelle always dreamed of being a knight of Favonius when she grew up. She may not have what it takes to be a knight just yet, but she is learning. Working as a maid at the Knights'' headquarters, she is constantly taking notes on what constitutes knightly speech, knightly conduct, and knightly customs. She holds firm to her belief that one day she will join their ranks — she just needs to keep trying her hardest at everything she does.

Noelle has much greater dreams and ambitions than other maids in the Knights of Favonius.

Like anyone else in this city protected by the Knights of Favonius, she too dreams of donning the honored armor.

Even if her skills are not enough to pass the rigorous selection trials, she still wishes to observe and learn from them every chance she gets.

Aside from her training, she enjoys her current life, helping everyone in need.

"You can leave absolutely anything to me!"

That''s her signature line.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Noelle%2FProfile', 'Like most of Mondstadt''s young people, Noelle always dreamed of being a knight of Favonius when she grew up. She may not have what it takes to be a knight just yet, but she is learning. Working as a maid at the Knights'' headquarters, she is constantly taking notes on what constitutes knightly speech, knightly conduct, and knightly customs. She holds firm to her belief that one day she will join their ranks — she just needs to keep trying her hardest at everything she does.

Noelle has much greater dreams and ambitions than other maids in the Knights of Favonius.

Like anyone else in this city protected by the Knights of Favonius, she too dreams of donning the honored armor.

Even if her skills are not enough to pass the rigorous selection trials, she still wishes to observe and learn from them every chance she gets.

Aside from her training, she enjoys her current life, helping everyone in need.

"You can leave absolutely anything to me!"

That''s her signature line.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Noelle%2FProfile', 'Una sirvienta al servicio de los Caballeros de Favonius que sueña con unirse algún día a sus filas.
Al igual que otros jóvenes de Mondstadt, Noelle sueña en convertirse en una Caballera Honorable de Favonius. Aunque todavía no tiene las cualidades de un caballero, Noelle trabaja dentro del Ordo de Favonius como criada, a la vez que estudia con detenimiento cada palabra y cada movimiento de los caballeros. Tiene la firme convicción de que, siempre y cuando trabaje duro, llegará el día en el que portará la armadura de los caballeros con orgullo.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Noelle%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112005.png","nombre":"Máscara dañada","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112006.png","nombre":"Máscara sucia","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112006.png","nombre":"Máscara sucia","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112007.png","nombre":"Máscara amenazante","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100022.png","nombre":"Valbaya","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104174.png","nombre":"Topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112007.png","nombre":"Máscara amenazante","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-odette', 'genshin-impact', 'Odette', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Odette_Icon.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Support', null, null, false, 'The prima ballerina of the Korolevskiy Troupe, clear and unyielding as the ice.

In other lands, the word "dancer" often brings to mind someone warm and familiar, a gentle presence that offers comfort along life''s long road.

When one mentions the same in Snezhnaya, however, the image conjured is a touch frostier.

Odette Spessiva, prima ballerina of the Korolevskiy Troupe, appears on promotional posters wearing the same composed expression. Her gaze is calm and distant, her lips lightly pressed together, her face as still as a statue touched by frost.

That cold reserve only makes the fervor of her admirers more striking. Their devotion is not difficult to understand. Odette possesses an impeccable physique, and her performances combine a cutting austerity with tremendous dramatic tension.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Odette%2FProfile', 'The prima ballerina of the Korolevskiy Troupe, clear and unyielding as the ice.

In other lands, the word "dancer" often brings to mind someone warm and familiar, a gentle presence that offers comfort along life''s long road.

When one mentions the same in Snezhnaya, however, the image conjured is a touch frostier.

Odette Spessiva, prima ballerina of the Korolevskiy Troupe, appears on promotional posters wearing the same composed expression. Her gaze is calm and distant, her lips lightly pressed together, her face as still as a statue touched by frost.

That cold reserve only makes the fervor of her admirers more striking. Their devotion is not difficult to understand. Odette possesses an impeccable physique, and her performances combine a cutting austerity with tremendous dramatic tension.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Odette%2FProfile', '"Ella baila y baila... Las miradas y los corazones de todos siguen cada uno de sus gráciles movimientos, para luego caer cuando baja el telón ♪... Pero Odette, oh, Odette, Odette de Snezhnogrado, Odette de la Compañía Korolevski, Odette, la que no pertenece a sí misma ♪... ¿Anhela tu corazón ser el centro de atención en el escenario o poder bailar en solitario sobre las llanuras nevadas? ♪...".
En Snezhnaya, lograr que la gente de las tierras heladas acuda por voluntad propia a un teatro no es tarea fácil. En los días de viento gélido, las personas prefieren acurrucarse junto a la chimenea antes que caminar por la nieve para ver una función.

Sin embargo, la mayoría hace una excepción cuando se trata de ver los espectáculos de ballet de Odette.

Cada vez que su nombre aparece en los carteles del teatro, una larga fila se forma frente a las taquillas.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Odette%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101275.png","nombre":"Flor frigifeérica","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112146.png","nombre":"Lumiesquirla etérea","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101275.png","nombre":"Flor frigifeérica","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112146.png","nombre":"Lumiesquirla etérea","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113090.png","nombre":"Rama florida inmortal no chamuscada","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101275.png","nombre":"Flor frigifeérica","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112147.png","nombre":"Quiebracristal etéreo","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113090.png","nombre":"Rama florida inmortal no chamuscada","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101275.png","nombre":"Flor frigifeérica","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112147.png","nombre":"Quiebracristal etéreo","cantidad":18},{"ic