  ('gi-sucrose', 'genshin-impact', 'Sacarosa (Sucrose)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Sucrose.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Buffer / Debuffer', null, null, false, 'An alchemist with an insatiable curiosity towards the world and everything in it. Attached to the Knights of Favonius as an assistant to Albedo, her area of focus is "bio-alchemy." She strives to enrich the world by transforming living things with the power of alchemy. Granted, the products of her research sometimes prove to be more weird than wonderful — but on the whole, she has made monumental contributions to the field of bio-alchemy.

Sucrose may be the assistant of the genius alchemist Albedo, but they could not be more different in research direction.

As opposed to studying the essence of alchemy and the ability to create new life, she is far more interested in using alchemy to modify existing life, all the better to add variety and color to this world.

Despite her youth, she has already achieved some brilliant results. For example, she has been able to increase the nectar output of Sweet Flowers by 70% by irrigating them with a special potion.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sucrose%2FProfile', 'An alchemist with an insatiable curiosity towards the world and everything in it. Attached to the Knights of Favonius as an assistant to Albedo, her area of focus is "bio-alchemy." She strives to enrich the world by transforming living things with the power of alchemy. Granted, the products of her research sometimes prove to be more weird than wonderful — but on the whole, she has made monumental contributions to the field of bio-alchemy.

Sucrose may be the assistant of the genius alchemist Albedo, but they could not be more different in research direction.

As opposed to studying the essence of alchemy and the ability to create new life, she is far more interested in using alchemy to modify existing life, all the better to add variety and color to this world.

Despite her youth, she has already achieved some brilliant results. For example, she has been able to increase the nectar output of Sweet Flowers by 70% by irrigating them with a special potion.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sucrose%2FProfile', 'Una alquimista con una insaciable curiosidad por el mundo y todo lo que hay en él. Adscrita a los Caballeros de Favonius como asistenta de Albedo, su área de interés es la "bio-alquimia". Se esfuerza por enriquecer el mundo transformando seres vivos con el poder de la alquimia. Es cierto que los productos de sus investigaciones a veces resultan más extraños que maravillosos, pero en general, ha hecho contribuciones notables en el campo de la bio-alquimia.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sacarosa%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113001.png","nombre":"Semilla de huracán","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatt