  ('gi-sandrone', 'genshin-impact', 'Sandrone', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c8/Sandrone_Icon.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Alain Guillotin would call her Marionette. Behind this name was the story of a loved one he could not forget and whose memories he had naively tried to revive by creating her. But the moment she opened her eyes and tentatively spoke his name, he resolved never to call her that again. It was wrong, he realized, to make this exquisite little creation bear the weight of his sister''s life, and of his own mistake. This little creation deserved a life of her very own, just like anyone else born into this world.

But from time to time, he still addressed her by that name, if only in his thoughts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sandrone%2FProfile', 'Alain Guillotin would call her Marionette. Behind this name was the story of a loved one he could not forget and whose memories he had naively tried to revive by creating her. But the moment she opened her eyes and tentatively spoke his name, he resolved never to call her that again. It was wrong, he realized, to make this exquisite little creation bear the weight of his sister''s life, and of his own mistake. This little creation deserved a life of her very own, just like anyone else born into this world.

But from time to time, he still addressed her by that name, if only in his thoughts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sandrone%2FProfile', 'La séptima de Los Once de los Fatui, conocida como “La Títere”. Además de interpretar todos los fenómenos a través del prisma de las matemáticas, es una elegante dama que nunca falta a las horas del té.

Sandrone fue mencionada por primera vez en la descripción del tráiler de Tartaglia, Tartaglia: Sello del Permiso, en la que se menciona que Javert solo ha recibido una orden de ella por un motivo desconocido.

Tanto Tartaglia como el Trotamundos la describen como alguien siempre ocupada en una investigación sobre Autómatas. Además, está estrechamente vinculada a Pulonia y a Fagio, máquinas relacionadas con su vida personal, su investigación y su estilo de combate.

Sandrone es la creadora de las Katherynes y forma parte de los Fatui, aunque su historia también está ligada a Fontaine, a Alain Guillotin y a la antigua Comunidad Cruz de los Narcisos.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sandrone%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112123.png","nombre":"Eje reforzado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113086.png","nombre":"Pluma celestecaída","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112123.png","nombre":"E