  ('gi-kokomi', 'genshin-impact', 'Sangonomiya Kokomi', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Kokomi.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer) / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'Kokomi is the Divine Priestess of Watatsumi Island, and also serves as its supreme leader. She is well-versed in the art of war, is good at strategizing, and has keen insights into military affairs. She is also adept at handling domestic affairs, diplomacy, and other matters. 
Still, this unfathomable leader has a mysterious side to her...

The inhabitants of Watatsumi Island once lived in Enkanomiya, at the bottom of the sea.

It was only by the grace of the god Orobaxi bringing them up to the surface that the civilization of Watatsumi Island exists today.

When Orobaxi was slain by the Electro Archon, its body was left as a skeleton and its resentment permeated the land, giving rise to Tatarigami.

Yet its desire to protect Watatsumi Island never faded.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kokomi%2FProfile', 'Kokomi is the Divine Priestess of Watatsumi Island, and also serves as its supreme leader. She is well-versed in the art of war, is good at strategizing, and has keen insights into military affairs. She is also adept at handling domestic affairs, diplomacy, and other matters. 
Still, this unfathomable leader has a mysterious side to her...

The inhabitants of Watatsumi Island once lived in Enkanomiya, at the bottom of the sea.

It was only by the grace of the god Orobaxi bringing them up to the surface that the civilization of Watatsumi Island exists today.

When Orobaxi was slain by the Electro Archon, its body was left as a skeleton and its resentment permeated the land, giving rise to Tatarigami.

Yet its desire to protect Watatsumi Island never faded.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kokomi%2FProfile', 'La Sacerdotisa Divina y quien controla todos los asuntos de la Isla Watatsumi.

Sangonomiya Kokomi es una hermosa damisela. A pesar de su apariencia elegante, en realidad es la líder de la Tropas de Watatsumi. Ella es una asesora militar sabia e ingeniosa. Aunque siempre luce una sonrisa muy serena, en realidad lo tiene todo arreglado y a su alcance. Ella es el cerebro de la fuerza. Es la Sacerdotisa Divina de la Isla Watatsumi, la líder suprema de la Isla Watatsumi.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sangonomiya%20Kokomi%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112053.png","nombre":"Caparazón espectral","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113028.png","nombre":"Rocío del rechazo","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre":"Perla de coral","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112054.png","nombre":"Corazón espectral","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113028.png","nombre":"Rocío del rechazo","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101207.png","nombre"