  ('gi-sayu', 'genshin-impact', 'Sayu', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Sayu.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'Sayu, Shuumatsuban''s resident ninja, is obsessed with sleeping and growing taller. She has mastered all kinds of ninjutsu to run away and hide in pursuit of opportunities to laze around and sleep. Such an extraordinary skillset may have very unexpected uses.

Most Inazumans are unaware of the existence of the Shuumatsuban. In fact, the Shuumatsuban is a secret organization under the Yashiro Commission.

There is also a little ninja who goes by the name of Sayu in the Shuumatsuban, and this fact is even less known.

Sayu is a special existence in the Shuumatsuban. She has been raised in the Shuumatsuban since she was a child, and is extremely loyal to the organization.

That said, her most prominent trait is not "loyalty", but "laziness."

Lazing around is what Sayu does best.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sayu%2FProfile', 'Sayu, Shuumatsuban''s resident ninja, is obsessed with sleeping and growing taller. She has mastered all kinds of ninjutsu to run away and hide in pursuit of opportunities to laze around and sleep. Such an extraordinary skillset may have very unexpected uses.

Most Inazumans are unaware of the existence of the Shuumatsuban. In fact, the Shuumatsuban is a secret organization under the Yashiro Commission.

There is also a little ninja who goes by the name of Sayu in the Shuumatsuban, and this fact is even less known.

Sayu is a special existence in the Shuumatsuban. She has been raised in the Shuumatsuban since she was a child, and is extremely loyal to the organization.

That said, her most prominent trait is not "loyalty", but "laziness."

Lazing around is what Sayu does best.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sayu%2FProfile', 'Una ninja perteneciente a Los Ocelos. Muy bajita y siempre con aspecto de no haber dormido suficiente.

Una ninja perteneciente a Los Ocelos. Bajita, pero de movimientos extremadamente ágiles.

Oh, ¿su estatura?... Bueno, Sayu dejó de crecer hace mucho tiempo... Ella incluso piensa que se encuentra atrapada en un sueño donde el tiempo se detuvo.

¿Cuándo se supone que voy a crecer? ¿Será que no duermo lo suficiente?

A menudo se despierta con ese pensamiento, entonces vuelve a acurrucarse y a dormirse.

Sayu cree que, si continúa durmiendo, podrá recuperar energía y así crecer. Por eso, hace todo lo posible por holgazanear y practicar las técnicas ninja.

Saltar, camuflarse, rastrear, transformarse... No importa qué destreza sea, Sayu las domina todas con gran maestría.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sayu%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113022.png","nombre":"Engranaje Oni","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","nombre":"Néctar brillante","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113022.png","nombre":"Engranaje Oni","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101203.png","nombre":"Médula cristalizada","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","nombre":"Néctar brillante","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe