  ('gi-sethos', 'genshin-impact', 'Sethos', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Sethos.png', '4', 'Electro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'A mysterious desert youth with a friendly smile who loves traveling by foot across both rainforest and desert.

A new face appeared in town, though none can recall when he first showed up.

The young man from the desert would show up at any occasion he was inclined to attend with a bearing so confident and natural that many only realized quite some time later that the person they had spoken with earlier was, in fact, a newcomer. After much asking around, they finally found out his name: Sethos.

"So, where did you meet again? He''s an old friend of yours, right?" People would ask each other such questions, before discovering to their surprise that none of them had known him for long.

Like a grain of sand blown over the high city walls by some wild desert wind, Sethos blended into the crowd with ease, speaking with them of homelands and travels.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sethos%2FProfile', 'A mysterious desert youth with a friendly smile who loves traveling by foot across both rainforest and desert.

A new face appeared in town, though none can recall when he first showed up.

The young man from the desert would show up at any occasion he was inclined to attend with a bearing so confident and natural that many only realized quite some time later that the person they had spoken with earlier was, in fact, a newcomer. After much asking around, they finally found out his name: Sethos.

"So, where did you meet again? He''s an old friend of yours, right?" People would ask each other such questions, before discovering to their surprise that none of them had known him for long.

Like a grain of sand blown over the high city walls by some wild desert wind, Sethos blended into the crowd with ease, speaking with them of homelands and travels.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sethos%2FProfile', 'Tendrás la astucia de un zorro, la agilidad de una serpiente voladora, y la sabiduría de Hermanubis te otorgará su favor. Te llamarás SethosEl vasto e infinito mar de arena a menudo atrapa a los viajeros inexpertos. De no ser por la oportuna guía de un alma bondadosa, su viaje de exploración podría haber llegado a un final prematuro y cruelmente truncado. Todos los que se han perdido y han vuelto con sus compañeros mencionan el mismo nombre: Sethos.

"Posee un gran sentido de la orientación", "apasionado y amable"... Estas son algunas de las impresiones que tienen todos los viajeros a los que Sethos ha guiado. Y, ciertamente, así es. Como habitante del desierto, Sethos conoce los caminos entre los distintos oasis como la palma de su mano. Es muy hábil orientándose con la posición del sol y utilizando distintas técnicas de orientación.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sethos%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101224.png","nombre":"Trishiraíta","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101224.png","nombre":"Trishiraíta","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112065.png","nombre":"Satén rojo descolorido","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101224.png","nombre":"Trishiraíta","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112066.png","nombre":"Seda roja bordada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101224.png","nombre":"Trishiraíta","cantidad":30},{"