  ('gi-shenhe', 'genshin-impact', 'Shenhe', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Shenhe.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'Buffer / Sub-DPS', null, null, false, 'Shenhe was originally from a branch family of exorcists, but due to a series of coincidences, she became the disciple of an adeptus.

She is a student solely of Cloud Retainer in name, but her impressive constitution and intelligence quickly won several other adepti over.

She would go on to learn from them all, eventually becoming a master of adeptal arts in her own right as a mortal.

She very much looks the part as well in her unique temperament and manner of carrying herself — indeed, it would be no understatement to name her a true adeptus upon meeting her for the first time.

However, it is precisely due to the long years of tutelage that she has lacked company save for the adepti and odd passing illuminated beast.

This isolation has caused her to grow distant and indifferent.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Shenhe%2FProfile', 'Shenhe was originally from a branch family of exorcists, but due to a series of coincidences, she became the disciple of an adeptus.

She is a student solely of Cloud Retainer in name, but her impressive constitution and intelligence quickly won several other adepti over.

She would go on to learn from them all, eventually becoming a master of adeptal arts in her own right as a mortal.

She very much looks the part as well in her unique temperament and manner of carrying herself — indeed, it would be no understatement to name her a true adeptus upon meeting her for the first time.

However, it is precisely due to the long years of tutelage that she has lacked company save for the adepti and odd passing illuminated beast.

This isolation has caused her to grow distant and indifferent.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Shenhe%2FProfile', 'Recorrí numerosos mundos y enseñé a incontables discípulos. Entre ellos, Shenhe es la más parecida a míShenhe proviene de una rama familiar de un clan de exorcistas. Debido a ciertas razones, la Preservadora de Nubes la tomó como discípula.

Para Shenhe, la Preservadora de Nubes es una maestra conocedora y conversadora.

Una discípula de los Adeptus con una mirada perdida. Al haber vivido recluida en las montañas de Liyue, su carácter es tan frío y distante como el de los Adeptus.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Shenhe%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112038.png","nombre":"Néctar de Megaflora","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113031.png","nombre":"Pseudoaleta de dragón de las profundidades","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","nombre":"Néctar brillante","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113031.png","nombre":"Pseudoaleta de dragón de las profundidades","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112039.png","no