  ('gi-heizou', 'genshin-impact', 'Shikanoin Heizou', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Heizo.png', '4', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'A young prodigy detective from the Tenryou Commission. His senses are sharp and his thoughts are ingenious. No matter what unsolved case he''s facing, he can get to the truth in unexpected ways.

Shikanoin Heizou is an extraordinary young detective.

Though working at the Tenryou Commission, he is at odds with the usual impression of a public servant, who is expected to be "stern," "solemn"... and "solemn" again.

On the outside, he appears more well-behaved and polite than any other new hires, but on the inside, he is actually thumbing his nose at all the official mumbo jumbo.

Unlike his colleagues, he does not go to the Station to report for duty on a daily basis and rarely shows up for any routine patrols.

It can seem like ages since you last saw him, and you may finally chance upon him at some crime scene.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Heizou%2FProfile', 'A young prodigy detective from the Tenryou Commission. His senses are sharp and his thoughts are ingenious. No matter what unsolved case he''s facing, he can get to the truth in unexpected ways.

Shikanoin Heizou is an extraordinary young detective.

Though working at the Tenryou Commission, he is at odds with the usual impression of a public servant, who is expected to be "stern," "solemn"... and "solemn" again.

On the outside, he appears more well-behaved and polite than any other new hires, but on the inside, he is actually thumbing his nose at all the official mumbo jumbo.

Unlike his colleagues, he does not go to the Station to report for duty on a daily basis and rarely shows up for any routine patrols.

It can seem like ages since you last saw him, and you may finally chance upon him at some crime scene.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Heizou%2FProfile', 'El joven y talentoso detective de la Comisión Tenryou, de espíritu libre, alegre y vivaz.

Parece un debilucho, pero en realidad es el mejor detective de la Comisión Tenryou reconocido por todos.

Es un hombre con una imaginación desbordante y una meticulosa capacidad de razonamiento lógico, así como con un enfoque intuitivo sorprendente para la resolución de casos.

Cada vez que ocurre un crimen, mientras que sus colegas buscan pistas basándose en su experiencia, él ya ha encontrado la respuesta correcta tomándolo desde una perspectiva inesperada.

La gente siente una gran admiración por su poderosa intuición. Cuando dicen que su pensamiento y eficiencia es como una guía divina, es cuando Heizou mostraría confiadamente su típica sonrisa: "¡Puede que ni siquiera los Arcontes fueran capaces de hacerlo!"

El guardia Shikanoin tiene un ingenio y una perspicacia admirables. Es un hombre de gran talento, aunque nunca lo oculta.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Shikanoin%20Heizou%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112035.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo de bronce","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112036.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo plateada","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113035.png","nombre":"Colmillo rúnico","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101201.png","nombre":"Escaradiablo","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112036.png","nombre":"Insignia de cuervo plateada","cantidad"