  ('gi-sigewinne', 'genshin-impact', 'Sigewinne', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Sigewinne.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer) / Buffer', null, null, false, 'The head nurse of the Fortress of Meropide. As a Melusine, she uses her unique perspective to observe and care for those around her.

Within the huge undersea facilities of the Fortress of Meropide, Sigewinne''s infirmary is one of the few places open to all people at all times.

A guard might have a terrible bout of illness while out on patrol at night, and have to be helped over to the infirmary by his colleagues, only to find that a hot drink and a clean bed had already been prepared, awaiting his arrival.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sigewinne%2FProfile', 'The head nurse of the Fortress of Meropide. As a Melusine, she uses her unique perspective to observe and care for those around her.

Within the huge undersea facilities of the Fortress of Meropide, Sigewinne''s infirmary is one of the few places open to all people at all times.

A guard might have a terrible bout of illness while out on patrol at night, and have to be helped over to the infirmary by his colleagues, only to find that a hot drink and a clean bed had already been prepared, awaiting his arrival.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sigewinne%2FProfile', 'La enfermera jefa del Fuerte Merópide. Como melusina, utiliza su perspectiva única para observar y cuidar a quienes la rodean. En el Fuerte Merópide, donde el sol no brilla, la enfermería es el lugar más cálido.

Se dice que la enfermera jefa, encargada de la enfermería, fue quien la fundó. El Fuerte Merópide ha cambiado de manos varias veces en circunstancias caóticas a lo largo de los siglos, pero siempre ha existido un acuerdo tácito entre todos los que viven aquí de no perjudicar en modo alguno al personal médico.

La razón es sencilla: pocos médicos podrían soportar tratar a delincuentes y permanecer mucho tiempo en un lugar así.

Menos aún serían tan amables, simpáticos, atentos y considerados como Sigewinne.

En una ocasión, un recluso al que Sigewinne salvó la vida tras resultar gravemente herido al causar unos problemas, la proclamó emisaria de los cielos enviada para traer la salvación a los pecadores —un "ángel de la salvación"—, llegando a decir que predicaría dicho apodo p', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Sigewinne%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101233.png","nombre":"Flor rociomarina","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101233.png","nombre":"Flor rociomarina","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112080.png","nombre":"Condensado extramarino","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113057.png","nombre":"Agua intrascendible","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101233.png","nombre":"Flor rociomarina","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112081.png","nombre":"Fragmento extramarino","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113057.png","nombre":"Agua intrascendible","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101233.png","nombre":"Flor rociomarina","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104123.png","nombre"