  ('gi-tartaglia', 'genshin-impact', 'Tartaglia (Childe)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Tartaglia.png', '5', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'Meet Tartaglia — the cunning Snezhnayan whose unpredictable personality keeps people guessing his every move. 
Don''t be under any illusion as to what he might be thinking or what his intentions are. Just remember this: Behind that innocent, childlike exterior lies a finely honed instrument of war.

Despite holding one of the most senior positions in the Fatui as one of the Eleven Harbingers, Childe very much looks like the young adult that he still is.

He is a wolf in sheep''s clothing, however, for under the cheerful and confident appearance lies a deadly swordsman.

He is the youngest among the Harbingers, but one of the most dangerous among their number.

That said, Childe doesn''t seem to fit in well with the others.

As a fighter first and foremost, he is quite at odds with this organization of deceit and treachery.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tartaglia%2FProfile', 'Meet Tartaglia — the cunning Snezhnayan whose unpredictable personality keeps people guessing his every move. 
Don''t be under any illusion as to what he might be thinking or what his intentions are. Just remember this: Behind that innocent, childlike exterior lies a finely honed instrument of war.

Despite holding one of the most senior positions in the Fatui as one of the Eleven Harbingers, Childe very much looks like the young adult that he still is.

He is a wolf in sheep''s clothing, however, for under the cheerful and confident appearance lies a deadly swordsman.

He is the youngest among the Harbingers, but one of the most dangerous among their number.

That said, Childe doesn''t seem to fit in well with the others.

As a fighter first and foremost, he is quite at odds with this organization of deceit and treachery.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tartaglia%2FProfile', 'Tartaglia es un sujeto imprevisible proveniente de las tierras de Snezhnaya. No hace falta adivinar cuáles son sus intenciones. Solo hay que tomar esto en cuenta: detrás de esa apariencia inocente e infantil, se esconde una máquina de guerra precisa y perfecta.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Tartaglia%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100033.png","nombre":"Caracola estelar","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104121.png","nombre":"Pedacito de lazurita varunada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100033.png","nombre":"Caracola estelar","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112032.png","nombre":"Insignia del recluta","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100033.png","nombre":"Caracola estelar","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104122.png","nombre":"Fragmento de lazurita varunada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112033.png","nombre":"Insignia del sargento","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113012.png","nombre":"Corazón purificador","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/a