  ('gi-tighnari', 'genshin-impact', 'Tignari (Tighnari)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Tighnari.png', '5', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'An Avidya Forest Watcher and botanical scholar who graduated from Amurta. He leads a fruitful life of patrolling the rainforest, protecting the ecology, and lecturing fools every day.

Those who travel through Avidya Forest will sometimes meet a rather special Forest Watcher.

He has large ears, a long tail, and a slightly delicate face. If a less discerning eye were to appraise him, he might even look like some kind of small, rare animal native to the forests.

But anyone who has even been acquainted with him will know that there is clarity to his words and steadiness in his bearing.

"One moment, please. Judging from your equipment, you''re a traveling merchant bound for Sumeru City, aren''t you? Come back, please, you''re going the wrong way."

"I mean, just look over there. The leaves are dense and the air grows damper.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tighnari%2FProfile', 'An Avidya Forest Watcher and botanical scholar who graduated from Amurta. He leads a fruitful life of patrolling the rainforest, protecting the ecology, and lecturing fools every day.

Those who travel through Avidya Forest will sometimes meet a rather special Forest Watcher.

He has large ears, a long tail, and a slightly delicate face. If a less discerning eye were to appraise him, he might even look like some kind of small, rare animal native to the forests.

But anyone who has even been acquainted with him will know that there is clarity to his words and steadiness in his bearing.

"One moment, please. Judging from your equipment, you''re a traveling merchant bound for Sumeru City, aren''t you? Come back, please, you''re going the wrong way."

"I mean, just look over there. The leaves are dense and the air grows damper.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tighnari%2FProfile', '"Te dejo el mensaje. Traje del desierto dos bolsas de dátiles con miel. Siempre vienen bien para reponer fuerzas, ya sea de día o de noche. Muchas gracias por tener tanta paciencia con Collei y por ser tan paciente con ella. Espero que todo vaya bien en el trabajo y Collei esté esforzándose en sus estudios".

Incluso aquellos que se topan con todo tipo de infortunios en el Bosque Avidya serán afortunados si se encuentran con el guarda forestal que se hace llamar Tignari.

Pero si andas haciendo tonterías en el bosque por gusto, tal vez deberías evitar encontrártelo.

Tignari siempre se sirve de los métodos más profesionales para solucionar rápidamente cada problema y, al mismo tiempo, plasma toda su severidad en cada una de sus lecciones.

Existe un dicho que dice: Si menosprecias el bosque, acabarás metido en un aprieto. Si menosprecias a los guardas forestales, acabarás en el aula de estudio de técnicas de supervivencia.

En realidad, todo eso no son más que rumores.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Tignari%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104131.png","nombre":"Pedacito de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112059.png","nombre":"Espora fúngica","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113036.png","nombre":"Picogancho fúngico","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104132.png","nombre":"Fragmento de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113036.png","nombre":"Picogancho fúngico","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112060.png","nombre":"Polen fluorescente","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113036.png","nombre":"Picogancho fúngico","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104133.png","nombre":"Trozo de esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112061.png","nombre":"Polvo quistecristalino","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113036.png","nombre":"Picogancho fúngico","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101215.png","nombre":"Loto nilotpala","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104134.png","nombre":"Esmeralda nagadus","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112061.png","nombre":"Polvo quistecristalino","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113036.png","nombre":"Picogancho fúngico","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-wanderer', 'genshin-impact', 'Trotamundos (Wanderer)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Wanderer.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'If the measure of humanity is having a heart, then he cannot be deemed as such. If one without a heart experiences joy and sorrow, then he shall be a puppet most alike to humanity.

He needs not introduce himself, for ordinary folk will never get to know him.

Nor will he need to immerse himself in the sea of humanity, for he has long forsaken any worthless emotion.

Several times now he has risen and fallen, and now he lives only for himself.

"Wanderer" is how he believes he might be best described — he has no home, no kin, and no destination.

Like the breeze, he lives in this world, and he walks its length and breadth.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wanderer%2FProfile', 'If the measure of humanity is having a heart, then he cannot be deemed as such. If one without a heart experiences joy and sorrow, then he shall be a puppet most alike to humanity.

He needs not introduce himself, for ordinary folk will never get to know him.

Nor will he need to immerse himself in the sea of humanity, for he has long forsaken any worthless emotion.

Several times now he has risen and fallen, and now he lives only for himself.

"Wanderer" is how he believes he might be best described — he has no home, no kin, and no destination.

Like the breeze, he lives in this world, and he walks its length and breadth.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wanderer%2FProfile', '"Los creyentes forjan la gloria de los dioses, mientras que los incrédulos son testigos de su trascendencia. A él, sin embargo, no le asignaré a ninguna categoría, pues la incertidumbre es la base de su futuro camino".

Aquella noche, una sombra llegó a un lugar antiguamente conocido como "Tatarasuna". Los vecinos de la zona se habían marchado hacía tiempo, pero como si el destino lo hubiera decretado, un granjero llegó hasta allí mientras recogía percibetormentas para ganarse la vida. Así, bajo la luz de la luna, vio una figura fantasmagórica de pie en el borde de un precipicio.

Llevaba un sombrero ancho que ocultaba su rostro por completo. Sin embargo, el granjero podía oír su respiración a través del golpeteo de la lluvia.

Un momento después, la sombra habló: "Así es como deben de respirar los humanos".

El granjero se aterrorizó al pensar que podría haber encontrado un espíritu, y se escondió a toda prisa detrás de una roca. La sombra volvió a hablar: "¿De qué tienes miedo?', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Trotamundos%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112044.png","nombre":"Guardamano viejo","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112044.png","nombre":"Guardamano viejo","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112045.png","nombre":"Guardamano gemelo","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112045.png","nombre":"Guardamano gemelo","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112046.png","nombre":"Guardamano célebre","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101213.png","nombre":"Champiñón rukkhashava","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104154.png","nombre":"Turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112046.png","nombre":"Guardamano célebre","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113038.png","nombre":"Resorte perpetuo","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-varesa', 'genshin-impact', 'Varesa', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Varesa.png', '5', 'Electro', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'An orchard owner who normally leads a laid-back life. However, when her fighting spirit is ignited, she dons a unique mask and exudes the indomitable air of a legendary hero.

"Time for training, Varesa!"

Every morning the coach would bellow her thunderous words, so loud in fact that a cloud of dust would rise up from the orchard.

A few moments later, a core member of the Collective of Plenty''s Patrol Team and the manager of a popular orchard — Varesa, who had overslept — would clumsily bumble her way into the gym, a slice of jam-coated bread in her mouth.

At this point, Varesa would listen to her coach''s instructions with sleep-heavy eyes and a blank expression, before dutifully starting her warmups and slowly regaining her strength...

Occasionally, her coach would point out — that jam contains too much sugar, which means it''s punishment time!', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Varesa%2FProfile', 'An orchard owner who normally leads a laid-back life. However, when her fighting spirit is ignited, she dons a unique mask and exudes the indomitable air of a legendary hero.

"Time for training, Varesa!"

Every morning the coach would bellow her thunderous words, so loud in fact that a cloud of dust would rise up from the orchard.

A few moments later, a core member of the Collective of Plenty''s Patrol Team and the manager of a popular orchard — Varesa, who had overslept — would clumsily bumble her way into the gym, a slice of jam-coated bread in her mouth.

At this point, Varesa would listen to her coach''s instructions with sleep-heavy eyes and a blank expression, before dutifully starting her warmups and slowly regaining her strength...

Occasionally, her coach would point out — that jam contains too much sugar, which means it''s punishment time!', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Varesa%2FProfile', '"Ah, Varesa... mi discípula más especial. Nadie podría imitar su estilo tan despreocupado. Esté dónde esté, siempre parece una niña que está de excursión y solo piensa en la comida local o en buscar un buen lugar para acampar y dormir. Ahora bien, si alguna vez luchas contra el Abismo junto a ella, te aconsejo tener cuidado. Una vez que se pone la máscara, su ritmo de ataque se vuelve... un tanto agresivo".
Al hablar de los habitantes de la Comunidad de la Feracidad, la primera reacción de la gente de Natlan es elogiar su buena forma física y, inmediatamente después, les viene a la cabeza el grato recuerdo de la fruta dulce y verdura fresca.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Varesa%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101254.png","nombre":"Flor rocanubosa","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104141.png","nombre":"Pedacito de amatista vajrada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101254.png","nombre":"Flor rocanubosa","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112101.png","nombre":"Colmillo joven","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113072.png","nombre":"Núcleo inerte magmadracónico","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101254.png","nombre":"Flor rocanubosa","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104142.png","nombre":"Fragmento de amatista vajrada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112102.png","nombre":"Colmillo veterano","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113072.png","nombre":"Núcleo inerte magmadracónico","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101254.png","nombre":"Flor rocanubosa","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104143.png","nombre":"Trozo de amatista vajrada","cantidad":3},{"ico