  ('gi-varka', 'genshin-impact', 'Varka', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/98/Varka_Icon.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius and serving Knight of Boreas, guardian of Mondstadt. This title booms louder than the howl of the north wind, and his legend reverberates long after the ring of clashing blades falls still.

It is in bustling taverns that the grand tales of Varka are told, and they almost always begin with the extraordinary story of his birth.

Some claim that, when he was still in his swaddling clothes, two venomous serpents sought to slay the hero he was to be. Yet the infant, not a full month old, seized them, one in each hand, and tossed them from his cradle as if they were mere playthings. And thus, ''tis said, he grasped the secret to wielding twin blades!

Some say that, upon the very hour of his birth, a bitter north wind, the likes of which had not scourged Mondstadt in a century, tore through the sunlit skies. And from the depths of Wolvendom rose a chorus of wolf cries, one answering another.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Varka%2FProfile', 'Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius and serving Knight of Boreas, guardian of Mondstadt. This title booms louder than the howl of the north wind, and his legend reverberates long after the ring of clashing blades falls still.

It is in bustling taverns that the grand tales of Varka are told, and they almost always begin with the extraordinary story of his birth.

Some claim that, when he was still in his swaddling clothes, two venomous serpents sought to slay the hero he was to be. Yet the infant, not a full month old, seized them, one in each hand, and tossed them from his cradle as if they were mere playthings. And thus, ''tis said, he grasped the secret to wielding twin blades!

Some say that, upon the very hour of his birth, a bitter north wind, the likes of which had not scourged Mondstadt in a century, tore through the sunlit skies. And from the depths of Wolvendom rose a chorus of wolf cries, one answering another.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Varka%2FProfile', 'El Gran Maestro de los Caballeros de Favonius, así como el Caballero de Boreas que protege Mondstadt.

Según los comentarios de otras personas sobre él, Varka es una de las personas más poderosas de Mondstadt. Tartaglia lo llama el "Titán de los Caballeros de Favonius" y espera enfrentarlo algún día en combate, mientras que Bárbara dice que no hay nada de qué preocuparse mientras él lidere la expedición.

Sin embargo, parece que hay opiniones divididas sobre él. Para Diluc y Albedo, no parece ser una persona del todo de fiar, mientras Kaeya dice que admira sus métodos pero comenta que causó problemas a la gente de su alrededor hasta llegar a convertirse en leyenda. Uno de los personajes más cercanos a él es Mika y lo admira profundamente.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Varka%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112122.png","nombre":"Eje dañado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113085.png","nombre":"Cola prismática cortada","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112123.png","nombre":"Eje reforzado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113085.png","nombre":"Cola prismática cortada","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100021.png","nombre":"Gancho de lobo","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIc