/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104103.png","nombre":"Fragmento de diamante brillante","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112007.png","nombre":"Máscara amenazante","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100024.png","nombre":"Margarita voladora","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104104.png","nombre":"Diamante brillante","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112007.png","nombre":"Máscara amenazante","cantidad":24}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-wriothesley', 'genshin-impact', 'Wriothesley', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Wriothesley.png', '5', 'Cryo', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'Administrator of the Fortress of Meropide, he was given Fontaine''s highest honorary title of "Duke." Both low-profile and dependable.

To the great relief of the Maison Ordalie, most Fontainians are law-abiding citizens. As such, the Fortress of Meropide is not a place that they will ever visit in their lives.

At the same time, there is an easily understood yet rather tragic truth, which is that those who have served time often find it difficult to reintegrate back into the "overworld," and few will actively speak of their experiences in the "underworld."

Rather than a specific place, the Fortress is more like an idea, a warning, a symbol of misfortune and castigation — a byword amongst Fontainians.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wriothesley%2FProfile', 'Administrator of the Fortress of Meropide, he was given Fontaine''s highest honorary title of "Duke." Both low-profile and dependable.

To the great relief of the Maison Ordalie, most Fontainians are law-abiding citizens. As such, the Fortress of Meropide is not a place that they will ever visit in their lives.

At the same time, there is an easily understood yet rather tragic truth, which is that those who have served time often find it difficult to reintegrate back into the "overworld," and few will actively speak of their experiences in the "underworld."

Rather than a specific place, the Fortress is more like an idea, a warning, a symbol of misfortune and castigation — a byword amongst Fontainians.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wriothesley%2FProfile', '"Navia, ¿recuerdas cuando, hace unos años, rechacé el título de conde con el que me quiso condecorar el Palacio Mermonia? Bueno, eso no es lo importante. Hoy por fin conocí al alcaide del Fuerte Merópide. Siempre pensé que un título tan importante como el de duque era algo completamente accesorio... Pero ese tal Wriothesley es mucho más avezado de lo que aparenta".

"Alcaide del Fuerte Merópide".

Si Wriothesley tuviera una tarjeta de presentación, eso sería lo único que pondría en ella.

Sin palabrería innecesaria, supervisa ese taciturno lugar del fondo marino al que van los criminales desterrados.

Como lugar de residencia de malhechores, y a pesar de la discreción del lugar, los conflictos de intereses del Fuerte Merópide son motivo de corrupción para muchos.

En realidad, aunque alguien tramara entrar a escondidas en este sitio, desaparecería tan rápidamente como un trocito de pan en una sopa.

Cuando alguien adula al Ilustrísimo Sr.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Wriothesley%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104161.png","nombre":"Pedacito de jade shivada","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112083.png","nombre":"Engranaje de malla","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113052.png","nombre":"Dispositivo de Tubion","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104162.png","nombre":"Fragmento de jade shivada","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113052.png","nombre":"Dispositivo de Tubion","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101239.png","nombre":"Unidad de subdetección","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104163.png","nombre":"Trozo de jade shivada","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112084.png","nombre":"Mecaengranaje recto","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113052.png","nombre":"Dispo