  ('gi-xianyun', 'genshin-impact', 'Xianyun (Preservadora)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Liuyun.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'Support (Healer) / Buffer', null, null, false, 'A mysterious woman who has just moved to Liyue Harbor and claims to be reserved, quiet, and socially inept.

According to the "Thrice Annotated Version of the Full Record of Pristine Pavilion," a roaming adeptus travels with the "Spirit of Eight Pure and Mighty Rose-Clouds," dancing through the air as though "riding light and striding lightning." Their lives, too, are long beyond mortal reckoning. What humans call a millennium is but time for a short rest for the adeptus in their abode. As the saying goes, "Night and day belong not in paradise."

As for where the adepti dwell, the "Full Record of Pristine Pavilion" asserts that the sky is their pillow and the earth their mat, and that they may dwell in the mountains, rivers, lakes, and seas — and this indeed seems to explain the countless adeptal encounters recorded in the annals of Liyue''s history.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Xianyun%2FProfile', 'A mysterious woman who has just moved to Liyue Harbor and claims to be reserved, quiet, and socially inept.

According to the "Thrice Annotated Version of the Full Record of Pristine Pavilion," a roaming adeptus travels with the "Spirit of Eight Pure and Mighty Rose-Clouds," dancing through the air as though "riding light and striding lightning." Their lives, too, are long beyond mortal reckoning. What humans call a millennium is but time for a short rest for the adeptus in their abode. As the saying goes, "Night and day belong not in paradise."

As for where the adepti dwell, the "Full Record of Pristine Pavilion" asserts that the sky is their pillow and the earth their mat, and that they may dwell in the mountains, rivers, lakes, and seas — and this indeed seems to explain the countless adeptal encounters recorded in the annals of Liyue''s history.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Xianyun%2FProfile', '¿Dices que alguien nuevo se ha mudado a la ciudad? Oh, es Preser... Ah, no, es Xianyun. No tengas en cuenta ese carácter que ella tiene... Cuando se le necesita en los momentos importantes, siempre estará ahí para quien lo necesite. Si algún día te ves en problemas, no dudes en acudir a ella, siempre es la primera en ofrecerse a ayudar

Todo el mundo tiene algo que decir sobre Xianyun: "Esa mujer alta de pelo despeinado", "Esa artesana con gafas", o quizás "Esa vecina a la que le gusta tanto hablar". Cada persona opina algo diferente, pero todos sus comentarios conforman la imagen de la impresión que ella deja en los demás: una mujer divertida, dicharachera, amable y de trato fácil.

No obstante, eso no tiene nada que ver con la imagen que Xianyun tiene de sí misma. A sus ojos, ella es una persona de pocas palabras, reservada, una vanidosa implacable...', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Xianyun%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112008.png","nombre":"Pergamino guía","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112009.png","nombre":"Pergamino hechizado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104153.png","nombre":"Trozo de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_101241.png","nombre":"Jade cristalino","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104154.png","nombre":"Turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112010.png","nombre":"Pergamino maldito","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113058.png","nombre":"Nimboescama","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-xiao', 'genshin-impact', 'Xiao', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Xiao.png', '5', 'Anemo', 90, null, 'DPS', null, null, false, 'One of the mighty and illuminated adepti guarding Liyue, also heralded as the "Vigilant Yaksha." Despite his youthful appearance, tales of his exploits have been documented for millennia. He is especially fond of Wangshu Inn''s Almond Tofu. This is because it tastes just like the sweet dreams he used to devour.

Xiao may have the appearance of a young man, but his true age is something over two thousand years.

Fortunately, people do not tend to underestimate him on the basis of his appearance — one only needs to spend a short time with Xiao to clarify that he is not someone to be trifled with.

Xiao is a man of few words. He is highly dangerous, and has the most piercing gaze you''ve ever seen.

He enjoys a formidable reputation and high level of seniority among the adepti, but is relatively unknown in the mortal realm.

This is inevitable.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Xiao%2FProfile', 'One of the mighty and illuminated adepti guarding Liyue, also heralded as the "Vigilant Yaksha." Despite his youthful appearance, tales of his exploits have been documented for millennia. He is especially fond of Wangshu Inn''s Almond Tofu. This is because it tastes just like the sweet dreams he used to devour.

Xiao may have the appearance of a young man, but his true age is something over two thousand years.

Fortunately, people do not tend to underestimate him on the basis of his appearance — one only needs to spend a short time with Xiao to clarify that he is not someone to be trifled with.

Xiao is a man of few words. He is highly dangerous, and has the most piercing gaze you''ve ever seen.

He enjoys a formidable reputation and high level of seniority among the adepti, but is relatively unknown in the mortal realm.

This is inevitable.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Xiao%2FProfile', 'Un Yaksha y Adeptus que protege Liyue. También llamado el “Gran Cazador de Demonios” o “Guardián Yaksha”.

Uno de los poderosos e iluminados Adeptus que custodian Liyue. También llamado el "Guardián Yaksha". A pesar de tener una apariencia joven, algunas de sus hazañas ya aparecen en libros antiguos de hace miles de años atrás. Le gusta especialmente el tofu de almendras de la Posada Wangshu. Le encanta este plato porque le sabe igual que los sueños que solía devorar.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Xiao%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104151.png","nombre":"Pedacito de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113016.png","nombre":"Jade inmaduro","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104152.png","nombre":"Fragmento de turquesa vayuda","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113016.png","nombre":"Jade inmaduro","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100031.png","nombre":"Flor chingxin","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe