  ('gi-xingqiu', 'genshin-impact', 'Xingchiu (Xingqiu)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Xingqiu.png', '4', 'Hydro', 90, null, 'Sub-DPS / Support', null, null, false, 'The second son of the Feiyun Commerce Guild, Xingqiu has had a reputation for being studious and polite ever since he was a young child. But there is another side to the mild-mannered Xingqiu everyone knows. A daring, adventurous and much more mischievous side...

