  ('gi-yaoyao', 'genshin-impact', 'Yaoyao', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Yaoyao.png', '4', 'Dendro', 90, null, 'Support (Healer)', null, null, false, 'A young adepti disciple who is generous and sincere. She is used to taking care of everyone around her. She trains under her master at Liyue Harbor and regularly travels between the mountains and the city. Although she does not say it outright, she prefers bustling city markets to the tranquil mountains.

The adepti faithfully adhere to the contract that they have with Rex Lapis, and have thus defended Liyue for millennia.

When danger arises in Liyue, the adepti are sure to come forth, and they do show up from time to time when the land is at peace.

Sometimes, they do so to punish those who harbor evil in their hearts, and sometimes they intervene to save the imprisoned.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Yaoyao%2FProfile', 'A young adepti disciple who is generous and sincere. She is used to taking care of everyone around her. She trains under her master at Liyue Harbor and regularly travels between the mountains and the city. Although she does not say it outright, she prefers bustling city markets to the tranquil mountains.

The adepti faithfully adhere to the contract that they have with Rex Lapis, and have thus defended Liyue for millennia.

