  ('gi-zhongli', 'genshin-impact', 'Zhongli (Arconte Geo)', 'https://enka.network/ui/UI_AvatarIcon_Zhongli.png', '5', 'Geo', 90, null, 'Tanque / Debuffer', null, null, false, 'Wangsheng Funeral Parlor''s mysterious consultant. Handsome, elegant, and surpassingly learned. Though no one knows where Zhongli is from, he is a master of courtesy and rules. From his seat at Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, he performs all manner of rituals.

In Liyue''s traditional customs, "receiving adepti" and "sending adepti off" are equally important.

The Hus of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, who have been in this business for 77 generations, are the masters of handling funerals. However, Hu Tao, the current owner of Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, primarily focuses on the art of sending mortals on their way.

For the various ceremonies for sending adepti off, Hu Tao usually employs the help of a friend in more or less the same business. That person''s name is Zhongli. The adepti have been with Liyue for millennia, but only a handful have ascended in the past three thousand years, which means that everything regarding the traditions now only exists in texts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Zhongli%2FProfile', 'Wangsheng Funeral Parlor''s mysterious consultant. Handsome, elegant, and surpassingly learned. Though no one knows where Zhongli is from, he is a master of courtesy and rules. From his seat at Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, he performs all manner of rituals.

In Liyue''s traditional customs, "receiving adepti" and "sending adepti off" are equally important.

The Hus of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, who have been in this business for 77 generations, are the masters of handling funerals. However, Hu Tao, the current owner of Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, primarily focuses on the art of sending mortals on their way.

For the various ceremonies for sending adepti off, Hu Tao usually employs the help of a friend in more or less the same business. That person''s name is Zhongli. The adepti have been with Liyue for millennia, but only a handful have ascended in the past three thousand years, which means that everything regarding the traditions now only exists in texts.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Zhongli%2FProfile', 'Misterioso asesor de la Funeraria El Camino. Erudito y con información sobre todo tipo de cosas.

Un misterioso hombre invitado por la Funeraria El Camino. Un gran conocedor de todos los saberes. Zhongli no parpadea al pagar (o pedir a otros que paguen). Con gusto paga el precio, sin importar cuán irrazonable sea, y pagará incluso más por las cosas que le gustan. La parte divertida es que Zhongli siempre olvida llevar su dinero con él.', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Zhongli%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112002.png","nombre":"Condensado de Slime","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112003.png","nombre":"Babas de Slime","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":8}]},{"desde":70,"hasta":80,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":45},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":80,"hasta":90,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100058.png","nombre":"Cor lapis","cantidad":60},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104174.png","nombre":"Topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112004.png","nombre":"Esencia de Slime","cantidad":24},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113009.png","nombre":"Pilar de basalto","cantidad":20}]}]'::jsonb),
  ('gi-zibai', 'genshin-impact', 'Zibai', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/22/Zibai_Icon.png', '5', 'Geo', 90, null, null, null, null, false, 'The White Horse Adeptus from Liyue''s legends, known as Zibai, is the most mysterious figure in Liyue''s myths.

The legends of Liyue make mention of a mysterious White Horse Adeptus.

Traces of her story are scattered throughout books and folktales. Yet, across these diverse sources, accounts of her appearance are never quite the same.

Some say she became a steed as white as snow and, in the days of the Archon War, aided Rex Lapis in attaining supremacy over the mortal realm.

Others whisper that her eyes, like amber touched with gold, hold the power to gaze through the desolate wastelands of time itself.

Still others claim she has always lived on the moon, listening to the wishes of mortals, and keeping watch over the world of flickering lights below.

Yet, amidst all these different accounts, none could truly capture her visage, nor paint a likeness of her form.

Whether amidst gentle tea-time chatter, or in debates pouring out over ink-filled scrolls, each view was a glimpse throug', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Zibai%2FProfile', 'The White Horse Adeptus from Liyue''s legends, known as Zibai, is the most mysterious figure in Liyue''s myths.

The legends of Liyue make mention of a mysterious White Horse Adeptus.

Traces of her story are scattered throughout books and folktales. Yet, across these diverse sources, accounts of her appearance are never quite the same.

Some say she became a steed as white as snow and, in the days of the Archon War, aided Rex Lapis in attaining supremacy over the mortal realm.

Others whisper that her eyes, like amber touched with gold, hold the power to gaze through the desolate wastelands of time itself.

Still others claim she has always lived on the moon, listening to the wishes of mortals, and keeping watch over the world of flickering lights below.

Yet, amidst all these different accounts, none could truly capture her visage, nor paint a likeness of her form.

Whether amidst gentle tea-time chatter, or in debates pouring out over ink-filled scrolls, each view was a glimpse throug', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Zibai%2FProfile', '"El viento siempre erosiona la bondad hasta convertirla en historias lejanas, y luego transforma esas historias en leyendas difusas, las cuales están destinadas a un olvido inevitable... ¿Por qué, entonces, escogiste este camino?".
En Liyue siempre han circulado historias populares sobre los Adeptus.

Ejemplos de ello son los «Registros del pabellón inmaculado» y su Adeptus ociosa que controlaba la lluvia para acabar con la sequía, o el texto «Yakshas: los guardianes Adeptus» y su mención a Alatus Nemeseos, el cual se dedicaba a erradicar las plagas.

Todos ellos eran seres poderosos que protegían la paz en cada rincón del mundo, y por ello eran venerados por la gente.

También está la Adeptus Yegua Blanca, cuyas huellas perduran tanto en los libros como en las leyendas populares.

Algunos dicen que tomó la forma de una yegua blanca y que ayudó al Rey Geo a conseguir su autoridad en el mundo de los mortales durante la Guerra de los Arcontes.

Otros dicen que sus ojos, dorados como el á', 'https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/es/wiki/Zibai%2FHistoria', false, '[{"desde":20,"hasta":40,"creditos":20000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100030.png","nombre":"Lirio de cristal","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104171.png","nombre":"Pedacito de topacio prithiva","cantidad":1},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":3}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":40000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100030.png","nombre":"Lirio de cristal","cantidad":10},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112125.png","nombre":"Distintivo desgastado","cantidad":15},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113084.png","nombre":"Vestigio de las alas del terror","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100030.png","nombre":"Lirio de cristal","cantidad":20},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104172.png","nombre":"Fragmento de topacio prithiva","cantidad":6},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":12},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_113084.png","nombre":"Vestigio de las alas del terror","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":60,"hasta":70,"creditos":80000,"materiales":[{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_100030.png","nombre":"Lirio de cristal","cantidad":30},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_104173.png","nombre":"Trozo de topacio prithiva","cantidad":3},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_112126.png","nombre":"Distintivo sofisticado","cantidad":18},{"icono":"https://gi.yatta.moe/assets/UI/UI_ItemIcon_11308